(201327, 11659, 5753, '<td valign="top">What a great picture!...However, you have to dig in to find where the square is.  IMHO, the door handles are the subjects, not the square.  Good work though 7.</td>', 'What a great picture!...However, you have to dig in to find where the square is.  IMHO, the door handles are the subjects, not the square.  Good work though 7.', '2003-01-27 12:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
