(201329, 11427, 3111, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, nice simple composition.  Colors complement each other and the background as well.  My favorite so far (8).  If I saw this in an art store, I would pick it up.</td>', 'Gorgeous, nice simple composition.  Colors complement each other and the background as well.  My favorite so far (8).  If I saw this in an art store, I would pick it up.', '2003-01-27 12:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(201331, 11514, 3111, '<td valign="top">Not sure about your choice of POV.  I would have loved to see the view from the balcony.  Maybe that creates the interest I am sensing in it.  Still, there are so many options here to fit the challenge, this place has potential.  Go back and shoot it often.</td>', 'Not sure about your choice of POV.  I would have loved to see the view from the balcony.  Maybe that creates the interest I am sensing in it.  Still, there are so many options here to fit the challenge, this place has potential.  Go back and shoot it often.', '2003-01-27 12:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(201332, 11558, 3111, '<td valign="top">If you had a wide angle lens, I would have shot just four of the windows.  The scope of the photos is too large.  You could even have a good composition if you just took a shot of one.</td>', 'If you had a wide angle lens, I would have shot just four of the windows.  The scope of the photos is too large.  You could even have a good composition if you just took a shot of one.', '2003-01-27 12:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(201333, 11630, 5753, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  The branches clutter the subject a little too much for my own taste.  I am drawn to the RHS of the window frame, where the edge of the window is not parallel to the edge of the picture - perhaps a larger crop area wouldn''t make it so obvious?  It would have put a little more colour in the picture too.</td>', 'Good shot.  The branches clutter the subject a little too much for my own taste.  I am drawn to the RHS of the window frame, where the edge of the window is not parallel to the edge of the picture - perhaps a larger crop area wouldn''t make it so obvious?  It would have put a little more colour in the picture too.', '2003-01-27 12:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(201334, 11369, 3111, '<td valign="top">Too many things going on.... to dark as well.  The day looks overcast - on days such as that, you might want to try B&amp;W to create a more "abstract" look and to take the dullness of the sun away.</td>', 'Too many things going on.... to dark as well.  The day looks overcast - on days such as that, you might want to try B&W to create a more "abstract" look and to take the dullness of the sun away.', '2003-01-27 12:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(201335, 11368, 3111, '<td valign="top">Nice compositon but the yellows are too harsh and doesn''t make the meal look that appetizing.  I don''t feel like eating now (which I think should be the objective of good food photography).</td>', 'Nice compositon but the yellows are too harsh and doesn''t make the meal look that appetizing.  I don''t feel like eating now (which I think should be the objective of good food photography).', '2003-01-27 12:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
