(201402, 11597, 5120, '<td valign="top">Overall I liked this picture.  I think that you made good use of shape and contrast.  The lighting is also pleasing.  The composition looks a little too contrived for me, but I think it is very difficult to get around this.  Maybe if you took the picture from a different angle it would work better for me.  I also would do without the border if it were my picture.  I like your use of black and white on this one and think it is a strong entry.  <br/> <br/>Just my two cents,<br/> <br/>Greg<br/> <br/></td>', 'Overall I liked this picture.  I think that you made good use of shape and contrast.  The lighting is also pleasing.  The composition looks a little too contrived for me, but I think it is very difficult to get around this.  Maybe if you took the picture from a different angle it would work better for me.  I also would do without the border if it were my picture.  I like your use of black and white on this one and think it is a strong entry.   Just my two cents, Greg ', '2003-01-27 13:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(201403, 11438, 5120, '<td valign="top">I think that this one was meant to be humorous, and maybe the joke is that the square is actually a pentagon!  The subject is a bit too centered for my taste.  I also find the sheet he is sitting on to be somewhat distracting.  There is nice use of shape in this picture though, and there are also some nice textures in the hair.  I gave it a 5.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I think that this one was meant to be humorous, and maybe the joke is that the square is actually a pentagon!  The subject is a bit too centered for my taste.  I also find the sheet he is sitting on to be somewhat distracting.  There is nice use of shape in this picture though, and there are also some nice textures in the hair.  I gave it a 5. Greg', '2003-01-27 13:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(201404, 11584, 5120, '<td valign="top">What an interesting item, is it actually that color or did you use a filter?  This picture is one of the few that grabbed my attention this week.  The background is a bit dark, but not too dark I think.  The color works well for me, and the texture is pleasing.  The shim looks like it was just kind of tossed down there, the composition might be helped if you set it slightly off center.  I dont find the border adding much to the picture, and if it were my picture I would not include it.  The lighting is nice and overall I think you have done a good job with this one.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'What an interesting item, is it actually that color or did you use a filter?  This picture is one of the few that grabbed my attention this week.  The background is a bit dark, but not too dark I think.  The color works well for me, and the texture is pleasing.  The shim looks like it was just kind of tossed down there, the composition might be helped if you set it slightly off center.  I dont find the border adding much to the picture, and if it were my picture I would not include it.  The lighting is nice and overall I think you have done a good job with this one. Greg', '2003-01-27 13:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(201405, 11562, 5120, '<td valign="top">There were quite a few boring entries this week (most of them were to me).  Yours caught my attention, I think probably because of the reflections in the water.  Focus looks nice and sharp and the color really gives me a feeling of a cold morning after a long rainy winter night.  The composition works for me, as I like how the center of focus is not smack in the center of the frame.  Its difficult to make an interesting square picture, but I think you pulled it off.  The only think I would change about it would be to drop the border.  It doesnt add anything for me, and it takes away some of the resolution that could have been used in your picture.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'There were quite a few boring entries this week (most of them were to me).  Yours caught my attention, I think probably because of the reflections in the water.  Focus looks nice and sharp and the color really gives me a feeling of a cold morning after a long rainy winter night.  The composition works for me, as I like how the center of focus is not smack in the center of the frame.  Its difficult to make an interesting square picture, but I think you pulled it off.  The only think I would change about it would be to drop the border.  It doesnt add anything for me, and it takes away some of the resolution that could have been used in your picture. Greg', '2003-01-27 13:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(201407, 11479, 2361, '<td valign="top">I''m fascinated to learn how you did this within the rules.  Jak 5</td>', 'I''m fascinated to learn how you did this within the rules.  Jak 5', '2003-01-27 13:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(201408, 11564, 2361, '<td valign="top">I am an admirer of good verticals.  This works for me, and fits the challenge well.  Jak 7</td>', 'I am an admirer of good verticals.  This works for me, and fits the challenge well.  Jak 7', '2003-01-27 13:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(201409, 11479, 6097, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  If you didn''t use PhotoShop (or another photo editor) to create this effect, I am assuming you have this design on a piece of glass between the background and the camera?  Very original!<br/> <br/>Thanks for sharing!<br/>Bill Miller (wackybill)</td>', 'Really nice.  If you didn''t use PhotoShop (or another photo editor) to create this effect, I am assuming you have this design on a piece of glass between the background and the camera?  Very original! Thanks for sharing!Bill Miller (wackybill)', '2003-01-27 13:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(201410, 11617, 5120, '<td valign="top">You have a modern art masterpiece here!  This is my number one pick for this week.  I love the composition and the use of lighting.  I wonder how you got such sharp shadows in this one.  I love the interaction of the colors and the texture of the boxes.  I cant think of a single thing I would change about it.  Very well done!<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'You have a modern art masterpiece here!  This is my number one pick for this week.  I love the composition and the use of lighting.  I wonder how you got such sharp shadows in this one.  I love the interaction of the colors and the texture of the boxes.  I cant think of a single thing I would change about it.  Very well done! Greg', '2003-01-27 13:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(201414, 11452, 4049, '<td valign="top">With that camera, you should be taking photos of more interesting subjects, plus that box is rectangular, not square.</td>', 'With that camera, you should be taking photos of more interesting subjects, plus that box is rectangular, not square.', '2003-01-27 13:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(201415, 11423, 5753, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and DOF, but can''t really say that a square jumps at me here.</td>', 'Nice colour and DOF, but can''t really say that a square jumps at me here.', '2003-01-27 13:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(201416, 11551, 6425, '<td valign="top">Good picture quality.  The bricks look new but the door looks old.  I really dont get a square feeling from this because the one door up, one door down vibe.  You might have achieved a better image by just shooting one door.</td>', 'Good picture quality.  The bricks look new but the door looks old.  I really dont get a square feeling from this because the one door up, one door down vibe.  You might have achieved a better image by just shooting one door.', '2003-01-27 13:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
