(201419, 11497, 6425, '<td valign="top">The green grass really accents the bricks.  Good clearity.  The building itself really doesn''t give off a good square picture.  I dont like the trees on either side.  All in all the image looks good.</td>', 'The green grass really accents the bricks.  Good clearity.  The building itself really doesn''t give off a good square picture.  I dont like the trees on either side.  All in all the image looks good.', '2003-01-27 13:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
