(201542, 11556, 3032, '<td valign="top">Very nice background, I have tried this for the Macro challenge with a Cyrix PR200MX, but couldn''t find a nice background. This is.<br/>Cool use of dof in combination with focus. Also blurs the background away in such a way that the attention stays in the front. <br/>Nice toning. Good angle.</td>', 'Very nice background, I have tried this for the Macro challenge with a Cyrix PR200MX, but couldn''t find a nice background. This is.Cool use of dof in combination with focus. Also blurs the background away in such a way that the attention stays in the front. Nice toning. Good angle.', '2003-01-27 16:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(201544, 11552, 933, '<td valign="top">Very ingenious! Using the pixels themselves as the subject for this challenge.  I think it needs to be sharpened a little  - ha ha.  Really though, very creative effort and it definitely stands out form the crowd in a good way.  8  md</td>', 'Very ingenious! Using the pixels themselves as the subject for this challenge.  I think it needs to be sharpened a little  - ha ha.  Really though, very creative effort and it definitely stands out form the crowd in a good way.  8  md', '2003-01-27 16:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(201545, 11521, 933, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF.  The dice almost seem to reach out to you.  Composition is a bit too symetrical for my liking.  Seems like the dice could be a bit higher. Veyr nice shot.  8  md</td>', 'Very nice DOF.  The dice almost seem to reach out to you.  Composition is a bit too symetrical for my liking.  Seems like the dice could be a bit higher. Veyr nice shot.  8  md', '2003-01-27 16:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(201555, 11506, 3111, '<td valign="top">Nice random pattern, I think the depth of field would be less distracting lower to the ground.  It is difficult to see why the squares are becoming unfocused...</td>', 'Nice random pattern, I think the depth of field would be less distracting lower to the ground.  It is difficult to see why the squares are becoming unfocused...', '2003-01-27 16:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(201561, 11377, 6332, '<td valign="top">The "grainy" effect adds to the atmosphere of this photo. Almost looks like graphic art!</td>', 'The "grainy" effect adds to the atmosphere of this photo. Almost looks like graphic art!', '2003-01-27 16:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(201566, 11435, 4536, '<td valign="top">Interesting and different, I am wondering if a closer look would have been better.</td>', 'Interesting and different, I am wondering if a closer look would have been better.', '2003-01-27 16:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(201567, 11373, 5266, '<td valign="top">If this is the famous museum... then you''ve spelled Louvre wrong!!!  I love the angle, the perspective!!  It''s a bit too dark, though.</td>', 'If this is the famous museum... then you''ve spelled Louvre wrong!!!  I love the angle, the perspective!!  It''s a bit too dark, though.', '2003-01-27 16:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(201568, 11619, 5266, '<td valign="top">Great detail!!!  And more than one square!!!  Impressive macro shot!!</td>', 'Great detail!!!  And more than one square!!!  Impressive macro shot!!', '2003-01-27 16:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(201570, 11388, 5266, '<td valign="top">No true squares here - the corners are all rounded.  Focus is soft.</td>', 'No true squares here - the corners are all rounded.  Focus is soft.', '2003-01-27 16:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(201574, 11531, 6332, '<td valign="top">The lighting of this picture is poor. A "cast shadow" from the tile is nice but the light source is too diffuse in this case. And why did you crop the picture the way you did?</td>', 'The lighting of this picture is poor. A "cast shadow" from the tile is nice but the light source is too diffuse in this case. And why did you crop the picture the way you did?', '2003-01-27 16:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(201575, 11391, 5266, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  The disarray of the blocks leads me to think a child may have piled them up and they''re getting ready to be knocked down.  Nice that you used more than one color!!  And I love Jiminy Cricket!!</td>', 'I like the composition.  The disarray of the blocks leads me to think a child may have piled them up and they''re getting ready to be knocked down.  Nice that you used more than one color!!  And I love Jiminy Cricket!!', '2003-01-27 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(201576, 11480, 6332, '<td valign="top">Very romantic, but I would have liked to see the flame of the candle, and I would have liked to have a better view of the orchids! Nice try though!</td>', 'Very romantic, but I would have liked to see the flame of the candle, and I would have liked to have a better view of the orchids! Nice try though!', '2003-01-27 17:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(201577, 11589, 6332, '<td valign="top">I can see it''s a block of ice, but I think the square shape doesn''t come out very well. A bit less cropping would have done it maybe.</td>', 'I can see it''s a block of ice, but I think the square shape doesn''t come out very well. A bit less cropping would have done it maybe.', '2003-01-27 17:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(201579, 11628, 6332, '<td valign="top">Nice angle of view and good choice of subject but I would have liked to see less depth of field. IMO this way the background is too distracting. It seems the area is floodlit by a large lamppost - the picture would have come out better at night I think, or during the day when it''s turned off. Keep going!</td>', 'Nice angle of view and good choice of subject but I would have liked to see less depth of field. IMO this way the background is too distracting. It seems the area is floodlit by a large lamppost - the picture would have come out better at night I think, or during the day when it''s turned off. Keep going!', '2003-01-27 17:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(201588, 11656, 5266, '<td valign="top">I like the texture &amp; composition of this photo.  Nice rich wood color!!<br/></td>', 'I like the texture & composition of this photo.  Nice rich wood color!!', '2003-01-27 17:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
