(202683, 11366, 4648, '<td valign="top">Someone went to a lot of trouble for this one.   Toast is a tad burnt on the top edge,  one yoke of the outside egg is a little darker than the other,  The butter on the toast did not melt.  Now for the photo:  It''s great.  I love it.  A colored plate might have helped see clearly the eggs are also square.  But it''s still good.  Now I''m hungary.  I''ll give you an 8 and fix me the same thing.</td>', 'Someone went to a lot of trouble for this one.   Toast is a tad burnt on the top edge,  one yoke of the outside egg is a little darker than the other,  The butter on the toast did not melt.  Now for the photo:  It''s great.  I love it.  A colored plate might have helped see clearly the eggs are also square.  But it''s still good.  Now I''m hungary.  I''ll give you an 8 and fix me the same thing.', '2003-01-28 23:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(202684, 11583, 5391, '<td valign="top">Good comic relief - I like the title.  Other than that, a very well-executed photograph.  Excellent focus and original idea.  (9)</td>', 'Good comic relief - I like the title.  Other than that, a very well-executed photograph.  Excellent focus and original idea.  (9)', '2003-01-28 23:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
