(203105, 11672, 6425, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting.  There is just enough darkness in the image to give it the right look.  What is the object sitting in the square? Good work.</td>', 'Interesting lighting.  There is just enough darkness in the image to give it the right look.  What is the object sitting in the square? Good work.', '2003-01-29 14:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
