(203107, 11361, 6454, '<td valign="top">i think that by not having any real pattern to your pictures brought alot of intrest to your picture. I think also by having the shapes angled where you can see the wholes in the objects brought more attention to your picture. Nice job</td>', 'i think that by not having any real pattern to your pictures brought alot of intrest to your picture. I think also by having the shapes angled where you can see the wholes in the objects brought more attention to your picture. Nice job', '2003-01-29 14:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
