(203110, 11372, 6454, '<td valign="top">I enjoy how you have displayed your image. I think that by showing the city through the squares makes everything much more appealing. I also enojy the mountain in the background that has been split apart by the squares. Nice Job</td>', 'I enjoy how you have displayed your image. I think that by showing the city through the squares makes everything much more appealing. I also enojy the mountain in the background that has been split apart by the squares. Nice Job', '2003-01-29 14:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(203111, 11452, 6425, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on this shoot.  I like how you captured the 3-D image of the box instead of just one side.  The picture seems a little blurry to me but that doesn''t take away from the total effect of the image.  The black backround really makes the box stand out.  Good job.</td>', 'Interesting take on this shoot.  I like how you captured the 3-D image of the box instead of just one side.  The picture seems a little blurry to me but that doesn''t take away from the total effect of the image.  The black backround really makes the box stand out.  Good job.', '2003-01-29 14:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(203112, 11656, 6454, '<td valign="top">I think that this picture was very nicely done. I think that by having the square being a relflection off of something creates much more intrest to the picture. I also think that the large balcj border around it creates much more intrest to the square. Nice job</td>', 'I think that this picture was very nicely done. I think that by having the square being a relflection off of something creates much more intrest to the picture. I also think that the large balcj border around it creates much more intrest to the square. Nice job', '2003-01-29 14:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
