(203136, 11562, 2920, '<td valign="top">This is a simple but very effective photograph.  The reflection of the sky in the manhole cover matches perfecly with the colouration of the damp road/path.  My only concern is with the bright edge along the top of the picture, which I find distracting - it interrupts the even tone and calm mood of the rest of the image.   (I also wonder how the photo might have looked had it been cropped square; creating squares within a circle within a sqare - not a criticism by any means - just a thought - as I guess it might have made the crop too tight.   A really excellent capture - well done.</td>', 'This is a simple but very effective photograph.  The reflection of the sky in the manhole cover matches perfecly with the colouration of the damp road/path.  My only concern is with the bright edge along the top of the picture, which I find distracting - it interrupts the even tone and calm mood of the rest of the image.   (I also wonder how the photo might have looked had it been cropped square; creating squares within a circle within a sqare - not a criticism by any means - just a thought - as I guess it might have made the crop too tight.   A really excellent capture - well done.', '2003-01-29 14:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(203137, 11560, 6479, '<td valign="top">lots of squares. too much negative space</td>', 'lots of squares. too much negative space', '2003-01-29 14:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
