(203231, 11390, 4648, '<td valign="top">I think this a beautiful.  Love the background, great choice. It helps the photo stay sentimental.  Beautiful piece of barn wood.  Beautiful grain, and it shows up so well.  The square looks like, and is in about as good of shape, mine I have of my father''s.  Truly great photo, and the techs are good also.  It''s a 9</td>', 'I think this a beautiful.  Love the background, great choice. It helps the photo stay sentimental.  Beautiful piece of barn wood.  Beautiful grain, and it shows up so well.  The square looks like, and is in about as good of shape, mine I have of my father''s.  Truly great photo, and the techs are good also.  It''s a 9', '2003-01-29 18:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
