(203248, 11487, 3942, '<td valign="top">A very creative interpretation of the challenge and a well done shot too. Perhaps I would have cropped a little different. IMHO the photo shows too much of the hand in the upper left corner. Overall it could be a little sharper too. Nevertheless a beautiful shot, I voted 8. Good luck!</td>', 'A very creative interpretation of the challenge and a well done shot too. Perhaps I would have cropped a little different. IMHO the photo shows too much of the hand in the upper left corner. Overall it could be a little sharper too. Nevertheless a beautiful shot, I voted 8. Good luck!', '2003-01-29 18:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(203251, 11600, 4648, '<td valign="top">Can''t really tell what this is.  Is it a navigational lock and dam?  I see the many squares was just trying to figure out what the photo was of.  Focus a little soft for me, making it hard to see what it is.  The background is cluttered and distracting.  Probably would help if maybe you had pulled back and showed a little more of it.  Anxious to find out about this one.</td>', 'Can''t really tell what this is.  Is it a navigational lock and dam?  I see the many squares was just trying to figure out what the photo was of.  Focus a little soft for me, making it hard to see what it is.  The background is cluttered and distracting.  Probably would help if maybe you had pulled back and showed a little more of it.  Anxious to find out about this one.', '2003-01-29 18:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(203256, 11497, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful old square building with square windows and square writing.  This is a beautiful photo.  just wish the sky wasn''t so washed out.  Can''t believe the condition of the grounds with the condition of the building.  Building  being so run down.  I really like the photo for a 7.</td>', 'Beautiful old square building with square windows and square writing.  This is a beautiful photo.  just wish the sky wasn''t so washed out.  Can''t believe the condition of the grounds with the condition of the building.  Building  being so run down.  I really like the photo for a 7.', '2003-01-29 18:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(203266, 11411, 3942, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t get the connection with the challenge title. Could have brought into a sharper focus too.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t get the connection with the challenge title. Could have brought into a sharper focus too.', '2003-01-29 18:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(203270, 11565, 5475, '<td valign="top">I love your depth of field in this shot.  I spent $10 buying blocks just like these, but entered a different shot instead.  <br/>Your colors are great... very vibrant without being over saturated.  I would like to have seen the little girl''s whole hand on the left side of the frame.  Getting the whole hand in might have been at the cost of less of her face???  Face is better than fingers, though.  Nice shot, very well done.  8<br/>JD Anderson<br/></td>', 'I love your depth of field in this shot.  I spent $10 buying blocks just like these, but entered a different shot instead.  Your colors are great... very vibrant without being over saturated.  I would like to have seen the little girl''s whole hand on the left side of the frame.  Getting the whole hand in might have been at the cost of less of her face???  Face is better than fingers, though.  Nice shot, very well done.  8JD Anderson', '2003-01-29 18:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(203271, 11487, 5475, '<td valign="top">This shot is one of my favorites this week!  Great idea.  I would have liked to see more of the image that is cut off at the right side of the frame.  I like that the eye is not in the center of the ''square, but I think it would have better balance if it were further from the upper right of the thumb.    This is a good shot and I give it an 8.  I would try some more versions and work with placement of the eye within the fingers.  This is a fun idea that I would try to get the best image possible to enjoy, not just for the challenge!<br/>JD Anderson  8</td>', 'This shot is one of my favorites this week!  Great idea.  I would have liked to see more of the image that is cut off at the right side of the frame.  I like that the eye is not in the center of the ''square, but I think it would have better balance if it were further from the upper right of the thumb.    This is a good shot and I give it an 8.  I would try some more versions and work with placement of the eye within the fingers.  This is a fun idea that I would try to get the best image possible to enjoy, not just for the challenge!JD Anderson  8', '2003-01-29 18:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(203275, 11552, 3942, '<td valign="top">I like the colours here, meets the challenge very well too. A large reprint of this shot would be probably great in a modern furnished apartment. But I don\\\''t like this shot very much as a submission to a photography contest. I trust in you, that this shot is really a photo, but it looks more as computer art to me. Nevertheless a unique and outstanding submission. I changed my vote from 3 to 6 after coming back and thinking a 2nd time about it...</td>', 'I like the colours here, meets the challenge very well too. A large reprint of this shot would be probably great in a modern furnished apartment. But I don\\\''t like this shot very much as a submission to a photography contest. I trust in you, that this shot is really a photo, but it looks more as computer art to me. Nevertheless a unique and outstanding submission. I changed my vote from 3 to 6 after coming back and thinking a 2nd time about it...', '2003-01-29 18:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(203276, 11613, 5475, '<td valign="top">Best Triscuit photo I''ve seen recently!  I was at the grocery store yesterday and I walked by the Triscuits and immediately thought of your photo!  It almost made me buy some!  I bought Oreos instead (the white fudge covered ones!).  Now I have a belly ache!  OK, back to the real reason I''m here...  Close up photography is tough to do well, and you have done a great job with your lighting of the cracker, focus, DOF, all is great.  Your background is not black and has some texture (or color variations) to it.  That''s fine with me, but it clashes some with your black border (IMO).    Overall, a nice image and I give it an 8.  Good Luck!<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'Best Triscuit photo I''ve seen recently!  I was at the grocery store yesterday and I walked by the Triscuits and immediately thought of your photo!  It almost made me buy some!  I bought Oreos instead (the white fudge covered ones!).  Now I have a belly ache!  OK, back to the real reason I''m here...  Close up photography is tough to do well, and you have done a great job with your lighting of the cracker, focus, DOF, all is great.  Your background is not black and has some texture (or color variations) to it.  That''s fine with me, but it clashes some with your black border (IMO).    Overall, a nice image and I give it an 8.  Good Luck!JD Anderson', '2003-01-29 18:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(203280, 11550, 5475, '<td valign="top">The grid is nice, but it is the dust that really makes this image.  Either your grate is not consistent dimensions across the grid, or your lens wasn''t parrallel and centered over the subject.  The grid thickness at the far right of the image and top of the image is consistent, but not at the left and to a lesser degree on the bottom.  Not really a big deal because the center of the image captures my attention with great details.  Nice job and Good Luck in the challenge.  7</td>', 'The grid is nice, but it is the dust that really makes this image.  Either your grate is not consistent dimensions across the grid, or your lens wasn''t parrallel and centered over the subject.  The grid thickness at the far right of the image and top of the image is consistent, but not at the left and to a lesser degree on the bottom.  Not really a big deal because the center of the image captures my attention with great details.  Nice job and Good Luck in the challenge.  7', '2003-01-29 19:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(203282, 11389, 5475, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and the details.  great use of DOF.  The only thing that would improve the image for me is the crop on the left side.  I think more green to the left of the wood frame, or grop it closer into the wood frame would work better for me.  Great image anyway!  Nice job.  9<br/> <br/>On a final review of my votes, I bumped this up to a 10, my only one!  Good job...</td>', 'I love the idea and the details.  great use of DOF.  The only thing that would improve the image for me is the crop on the left side.  I think more green to the left of the wood frame, or grop it closer into the wood frame would work better for me.  Great image anyway!  Nice job.  9 On a final review of my votes, I bumped this up to a 10, my only one!  Good job...', '2003-01-29 19:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(203283, 11462, 5475, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Pink Floyd, so I give it an 8!</td>', 'Reminds me of Pink Floyd, so I give it an 8!', '2003-01-29 19:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(203285, 11671, 5475, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  It has a very human feel to it, which I like more than anything.  I don''t know what your exposure data is, but I think a little more DOF would have helped.  I see the hands and the cube as your focus point, but the right arm is a very strong (if not the strongest) element in the photo, and it''s a little soft.  I love the way the right arm brings your eye to the hands and the cube.  Title is also great.  With better DOF I''d give it a 9 or 10, as is I give it an 8.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'I like this shot.  It has a very human feel to it, which I like more than anything.  I don''t know what your exposure data is, but I think a little more DOF would have helped.  I see the hands and the cube as your focus point, but the right arm is a very strong (if not the strongest) element in the photo, and it''s a little soft.  I love the way the right arm brings your eye to the hands and the cube.  Title is also great.  With better DOF I''d give it a 9 or 10, as is I give it an 8.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-01-29 19:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(203288, 11569, 5475, '<td valign="top">I gave some thought to this concept, but I didn''t have anything to make a square frame with, and my kids wouldn''t cooperate for me anyway.  Great job on placement in the image, technical aspects are all perfect.  I feel a different expression on her face would have given the photo more interest, though.  I really like the inner, thin white border.  It just blends in with the photo, except at the bottom right.  It really accents the image subject.  That''s the best use of borders I''ve seen yet on this site!!</td>', 'I gave some thought to this concept, but I didn''t have anything to make a square frame with, and my kids wouldn''t cooperate for me anyway.  Great job on placement in the image, technical aspects are all perfect.  I feel a different expression on her face would have given the photo more interest, though.  I really like the inner, thin white border.  It just blends in with the photo, except at the bottom right.  It really accents the image subject.  That''s the best use of borders I''ve seen yet on this site!!', '2003-01-29 19:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(203303, 11373, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  I love the somber feeling.  Looks like a painting.  Good job.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  I love the somber feeling.  Looks like a painting.  Good job.  Jacko.  8', '2003-01-29 19:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(203305, 11440, 2716, '<td valign="top">A square snow man.  lol.  thanks for the chuckles.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'A square snow man.  lol.  thanks for the chuckles.  Jacko.  7', '2003-01-29 19:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(203307, 11547, 5475, '<td valign="top">What a great shot.  On my first run though voting I gave it a 7.  On a more detailed review, I like it even more.  This looks like a difficult shot to capture, and you did so very well.  You meet the theme very well with the racquest strings.  I love how the raquest is sharp, but you''ve got the blurred motion of the birdie.  The neon yellow really grabs attention, too.  I like the fact that your background has some blue in it instead of an all black background.  The only thing I can comment on to improve is your background.  I find the wrinkles in the fabric to be alittle distracting, but it''s a minor detail.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What a great shot.  On my first run though voting I gave it a 7.  On a more detailed review, I like it even more.  This looks like a difficult shot to capture, and you did so very well.  You meet the theme very well with the racquest strings.  I love how the raquest is sharp, but you''ve got the blurred motion of the birdie.  The neon yellow really grabs attention, too.  I like the fact that your background has some blue in it instead of an all black background.  The only thing I can comment on to improve is your background.  I find the wrinkles in the fabric to be alittle distracting, but it''s a minor detail.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-29 19:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(203311, 11378, 6480, '<td valign="top">I like how this photograph is very creative because of the squares on the kid''s face.</td>', 'I like how this photograph is very creative because of the squares on the kid''s face.', '2003-01-29 19:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
