(203324, 11584, 5266, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.   Aren''t you glad they started to allow borders?  The border adds a lot to your photo, I find</td>', 'Nice colors.   Aren''t you glad they started to allow borders?  The border adds a lot to your photo, I find', '2003-01-29 20:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(203325, 11429, 5266, '<td valign="top">It''s round, not square.  I don''t feel this photo meets the challenge.</td>', 'It''s round, not square.  I don''t feel this photo meets the challenge.', '2003-01-29 20:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(203326, 11455, 6480, '<td valign="top">Really nice photograph. I like the lights and the color of the sky. Very creative also.</td>', 'Really nice photograph. I like the lights and the color of the sky. Very creative also.', '2003-01-29 20:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(203327, 11366, 6480, '<td valign="top">Good creativity. I like how you made the eggs square also.</td>', 'Good creativity. I like how you made the eggs square also.', '2003-01-29 20:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(203328, 11606, 5266, '<td valign="top">This is very busy.  I understand that it is a square of a quilt, but I can''t see the edges of the square very clearly.  Focus seems a bit soft in spots.</td>', 'This is very busy.  I understand that it is a square of a quilt, but I can''t see the edges of the square very clearly.  Focus seems a bit soft in spots.', '2003-01-29 20:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(203329, 11459, 5266, '<td valign="top">I see the squares on the floor, but the subject of the photo is not a square (unless that''s what you''re implying).  Basically, this is a snapshot.</td>', 'I see the squares on the floor, but the subject of the photo is not a square (unless that''s what you''re implying).  Basically, this is a snapshot.', '2003-01-29 20:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(203331, 11374, 5266, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the lighting in this - the darkness in the "courtyard" area is too much.  And I really don''t see a true square in this photo.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the lighting in this - the darkness in the "courtyard" area is too much.  And I really don''t see a true square in this photo.', '2003-01-29 20:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(203332, 11593, 6480, '<td valign="top">I like how everything in the photograph is squares, well done.<br/></td>', 'I like how everything in the photograph is squares, well done.', '2003-01-29 20:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(203333, 11528, 5266, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a square here.  Interesting idea, but maybe for another challenge.</td>', 'I don''t see a square here.  Interesting idea, but maybe for another challenge.', '2003-01-29 20:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(203334, 11529, 6480, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and good creativity. But, I don''t really understand it.</td>', 'Nice colors and good creativity. But, I don''t really understand it.', '2003-01-29 20:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(203335, 11668, 5266, '<td valign="top">I think I would prefer a different tint to this photo - the blue doesn''t sit well with me.</td>', 'I think I would prefer a different tint to this photo - the blue doesn''t sit well with me.', '2003-01-29 20:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(203336, 11517, 6480, '<td valign="top">Excellent creativity. Really nice color also.</td>', 'Excellent creativity. Really nice color also.', '2003-01-29 20:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(203338, 11574, 6480, '<td valign="top">Really good creativity. I like how you put the ants on the piece of food.</td>', 'Really good creativity. I like how you put the ants on the piece of food.', '2003-01-29 20:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(203339, 11552, 5266, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t look like a photo - it looks like a computer generated pattern.  Yes, there are squares, but I don''t like the pattern or colors.</td>', 'This doesn''t look like a photo - it looks like a computer generated pattern.  Yes, there are squares, but I don''t like the pattern or colors.', '2003-01-29 20:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(203340, 11567, 5266, '<td valign="top">Not square - does not meet challenge</td>', 'Not square - does not meet challenge', '2003-01-29 20:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(203341, 11438, 6480, '<td valign="top">Pretty good creativity, but I think it is kind of strange.</td>', 'Pretty good creativity, but I think it is kind of strange.', '2003-01-29 20:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(203343, 11528, 6480, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I like how most of the picture is a reflection.</td>', 'Excellent! I like how most of the picture is a reflection.', '2003-01-29 20:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(203344, 11455, 5266, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s sort of a square, but not really (jagged edges).  I do like the lighting and colors.</td>', 'Well, it''s sort of a square, but not really (jagged edges).  I do like the lighting and colors.', '2003-01-29 20:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(203345, 11361, 6480, '<td valign="top">I like the different colors and the variety.</td>', 'I like the different colors and the variety.', '2003-01-29 20:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(203346, 11492, 6480, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph. I especially like the reflection in the center.</td>', 'Nice photograph. I especially like the reflection in the center.', '2003-01-29 20:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(203347, 11407, 5266, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a square here, and the subject certainly isn''t square.  Don''t understand what the title has to do with the photo, either.  On the up-side, I do like the composition and ragged look of the shoes.</td>', 'I don''t see a square here, and the subject certainly isn''t square.  Don''t understand what the title has to do with the photo, either.  On the up-side, I do like the composition and ragged look of the shoes.', '2003-01-29 20:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(203348, 11604, 5266, '<td valign="top">Well, there''s a square, and a definition, so I guess you meet the challenge.  I''m a bit tired of seeing entries like this, though - not a lot of originality.</td>', 'Well, there''s a square, and a definition, so I guess you meet the challenge.  I''m a bit tired of seeing entries like this, though - not a lot of originality.', '2003-01-29 20:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(203350, 11590, 5266, '<td valign="top">Not a square to spare LOL!!  I would give this a higher mark if I could make out the perforation line in the toilet paper.  The photo is a bit crooked.</td>', 'Not a square to spare LOL!!  I would give this a higher mark if I could make out the perforation line in the toilet paper.  The photo is a bit crooked.', '2003-01-29 20:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(203351, 11408, 5266, '<td valign="top">I do get it!!!  Nice composition, but the photo just leaves me a bit cold - perhaps different colors would help.</td>', 'I do get it!!!  Nice composition, but the photo just leaves me a bit cold - perhaps different colors would help.', '2003-01-29 20:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(203352, 11500, 5266, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a monitor.  Not too crazy about the image on the monitor.  And the photo seems to "bend" significantly.</td>', 'Nice capture of a monitor.  Not too crazy about the image on the monitor.  And the photo seems to "bend" significantly.', '2003-01-29 20:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(203353, 11545, 5266, '<td valign="top">Rounded corners, so it''s not a true square.  I don''t know what this coin actually looks like, but I imagine lighting would help with the color a bit.  It seems a bit washed out.</td>', 'Rounded corners, so it''s not a true square.  I don''t know what this coin actually looks like, but I imagine lighting would help with the color a bit.  It seems a bit washed out.', '2003-01-29 20:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(203354, 11486, 5266, '<td valign="top">The trees look a bit washed out.  I think I would prefer the photo with it cropped to meet the square on the top left hand side.  Hope you understand what I''m saying.</td>', 'The trees look a bit washed out.  I think I would prefer the photo with it cropped to meet the square on the top left hand side.  Hope you understand what I''m saying.', '2003-01-29 20:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(203356, 11564, 5266, '<td valign="top">A photo of a wall hanging?  Not a lot of originality.  Nice colors, though.</td>', 'A photo of a wall hanging?  Not a lot of originality.  Nice colors, though.', '2003-01-29 20:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(203357, 11487, 5266, '<td valign="top">Nice try.  I don''t like the reflection in the eye, but good detail in the face (wrinkles), but focus seems a bit soft on the fingers.</td>', 'Nice try.  I don''t like the reflection in the eye, but good detail in the face (wrinkles), but focus seems a bit soft on the fingers.', '2003-01-29 20:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(203358, 11406, 5266, '<td valign="top">Too many keyboard shots - not a lot of originality.</td>', 'Too many keyboard shots - not a lot of originality.', '2003-01-29 20:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(203359, 11514, 5266, '<td valign="top">Interesting -- I like the overall photo, but feel it''s a bit overexposed where the sun shines through the rails.</td>', 'Interesting -- I like the overall photo, but feel it''s a bit overexposed where the sun shines through the rails.', '2003-01-29 20:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(203360, 11558, 5266, '<td valign="top">A bit faded at the top.  I think a different angle would have made a better photo.  Perhaps cropping to the one building (get rid of the division between building sections?).</td>', 'A bit faded at the top.  I think a different angle would have made a better photo.  Perhaps cropping to the one building (get rid of the division between building sections?).', '2003-01-29 20:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(203362, 11517, 5266, '<td valign="top">Square pie?  An abomination!!  LOL - great colors, very crisp photo.  Good detail on the whipped cream and lime peel.</td>', 'Square pie?  An abomination!!  LOL - great colors, very crisp photo.  Good detail on the whipped cream and lime peel.', '2003-01-29 20:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(203364, 11392, 5266, '<td valign="top">Red Orange Yellow Green Blue Indigo Violet (I still remember Roy G. Biv from elementary school) - seems like you''re missing a couple of colors.  But I like the overall effect of the photo, and the uneven cropping.</td>', 'Red Orange Yellow Green Blue Indigo Violet (I still remember Roy G. Biv from elementary school) - seems like you''re missing a couple of colors.  But I like the overall effect of the photo, and the uneven cropping.', '2003-01-29 20:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(203365, 11375, 5266, '<td valign="top">I would like this better if the "swan" was centered in the middle of the square of unfolded paper.</td>', 'I would like this better if the "swan" was centered in the middle of the square of unfolded paper.', '2003-01-29 20:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(203368, 11440, 5266, '<td valign="top">All the other snowmen must laugh and call him names.  A mutant!!  Nice idea - lots of originality here!!  I like how he''s shot through the trees as if you had to hide from him.  You know what?  Your mark just went up!!!</td>', 'All the other snowmen must laugh and call him names.  A mutant!!  Nice idea - lots of originality here!!  I like how he''s shot through the trees as if you had to hide from him.  You know what?  Your mark just went up!!!', '2003-01-29 20:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(203369, 11632, 5266, '<td valign="top">Too washed out.  I don''t like the overal beige look.</td>', 'Too washed out.  I don''t like the overal beige look.', '2003-01-29 20:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(203372, 11430, 5266, '<td valign="top">Cute little lion.  I think I would like this photo more if I didn''t have to turn my head to see his head - turn the square on it''s corner.</td>', 'Cute little lion.  I think I would like this photo more if I didn''t have to turn my head to see his head - turn the square on it''s corner.', '2003-01-29 20:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(203373, 11626, 5266, '<td valign="top">Too many keyboards - not enough originality.</td>', 'Too many keyboards - not enough originality.', '2003-01-29 20:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
