(203467, 11570, 4648, '<td valign="top">love the composition, but don''t like the execution.  Realize you did it to make it stand out.  It''s different as it is and would have been beautiful in color.  It''s a really good photograph and your technicals are good.  Really like the cropping, but personally do not like your finish, whether sepia or whatever.  For me it went from an a  to a 4.</td>', 'love the composition, but don''t like the execution.  Realize you did it to make it stand out.  It''s different as it is and would have been beautiful in color.  It''s a really good photograph and your technicals are good.  Really like the cropping, but personally do not like your finish, whether sepia or whatever.  For me it went from an a  to a 4.', '2003-01-29 22:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(203472, 11634, 6425, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  The reflection was a good touch.  It gives the image good depth.  I also like the lighting  and the clearity.  Nice job.</td>', 'Good idea.  The reflection was a good touch.  It gives the image good depth.  I also like the lighting  and the clearity.  Nice job.', '2003-01-29 22:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(203480, 11374, 4648, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more light. Focus not bad.  I would like to see a little more on the left side, as much as you have wall on the right side.  Nice squares.  Worth a 5.  One question - what does you title "untitled film still" mean?</td>', 'Needs a little more light. Focus not bad.  I would like to see a little more on the left side, as much as you have wall on the right side.  Nice squares.  Worth a 5.  One question - what does you title "untitled film still" mean?', '2003-01-29 22:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(203488, 11514, 4648, '<td valign="top">Shame about the sun at the top of the stairs.  But still really great photo of stairs and the ceiling squares.  In fact, it is exceptional, especially considering everything you had going against you - mainly the position of the sun.  I''m surprised there are not more glares and shadows.  Great job.  Worth an 8</td>', 'Shame about the sun at the top of the stairs.  But still really great photo of stairs and the ceiling squares.  In fact, it is exceptional, especially considering everything you had going against you - mainly the position of the sun.  I''m surprised there are not more glares and shadows.  Great job.  Worth an 8', '2003-01-29 23:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(203492, 11656, 6425, '<td valign="top">I like this image.  The shadow really looks good with the lighting.  I like how the light is more bright inside on the shadow.  Good image.</td>', 'I like this image.  The shadow really looks good with the lighting.  I like how the light is more bright inside on the shadow.  Good image.', '2003-01-29 23:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(203493, 11649, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Glad you didn''t crop off the shadows of the chains on the snow.  That adds so much in my opinion..  Like how you can almost still see the chains at the top center where the sun almost (?) washed them out.  Plain and simple but beautiful.  Should be up there at the top.  I give it a 9.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Glad you didn''t crop off the shadows of the chains on the snow.  That adds so much in my opinion..  Like how you can almost still see the chains at the top center where the sun almost (?) washed them out.  Plain and simple but beautiful.  Should be up there at the top.  I give it a 9.', '2003-01-29 23:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(203495, 11391, 4648, '<td valign="top">Very colorful.  My only complaint, and it might be nit-piking is the space between the "Q" and "A" where the background is not black.  The space between the "W" and the "Z" needs to be a little dark but would not be that bad by itself.  Good sample of carved letters and painted letters.  Love the Jimny Cricket.  Without the background areas and the few shadows it would have been a 10.  Right now it''s an 8.  Still a very respectible photo.</td>', 'Very colorful.  My only complaint, and it might be nit-piking is the space between the "Q" and "A" where the background is not black.  The space between the "W" and the "Z" needs to be a little dark but would not be that bad by itself.  Good sample of carved letters and painted letters.  Love the Jimny Cricket.  Without the background areas and the few shadows it would have been a 10.  Right now it''s an 8.  Still a very respectible photo.', '2003-01-29 23:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(203496, 11637, 6425, '<td valign="top">The letter appear clear.  It was a good idea for squares.  What type of tone did you shoot in or is it black and white?  I might have tried sepia to see what that might look like, otherwise this was a good image.</td>', 'The letter appear clear.  It was a good idea for squares.  What type of tone did you shoot in or is it black and white?  I might have tried sepia to see what that might look like, otherwise this was a good image.', '2003-01-29 23:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
