(203797, 11535, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good<br/>Technical: Slighy out of focus top-left?<br/>Meets challenge: Yes!<br/>Overall impression: Funny from the title, but not sure if pic stands alone.  5</td>', 'Composition: GoodTechnical: Slighy out of focus top-left?Meets challenge: Yes!Overall impression: Funny from the title, but not sure if pic stands alone.  5', '2003-01-30 14:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(203798, 11632, 6481, '<td valign="top">The tone of this photo is nice. This picture is too blurry.</td>', 'The tone of this photo is nice. This picture is too blurry.', '2003-01-30 14:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(203799, 11389, 6454, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this picture was done very nicely. I think that by  moving away from the fence wold give the picture something more intresting. Nice work</td>', 'The lighting in this picture was done very nicely. I think that by  moving away from the fence wold give the picture something more intresting. Nice work', '2003-01-30 14:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(203800, 11619, 6451, '<td valign="top">Good idea! I would have never thought to use food to show the concept of a square. The picture is very colorful, although some of the items are not square so it sort of messes with the concept of the photo.</td>', 'Good idea! I would have never thought to use food to show the concept of a square. The picture is very colorful, although some of the items are not square so it sort of messes with the concept of the photo.', '2003-01-30 14:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(203801, 11627, 6481, '<td valign="top">Tjis photo is nice. I like the way the lines draw your eye throughout the picture.</td>', 'Tjis photo is nice. I like the way the lines draw your eye throughout the picture.', '2003-01-30 14:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(203802, 11668, 6454, '<td valign="top">I really like how you broke the entire image into many pieces. I also enjoy the fact that you are a hockey fan as am I. But I think that having a light blue background al helps create intrest in this image. Nice Work</td>', 'I really like how you broke the entire image into many pieces. I also enjoy the fact that you are a hockey fan as am I. But I think that having a light blue background al helps create intrest in this image. Nice Work', '2003-01-30 14:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(203803, 11646, 6451, '<td valign="top">Good subject. ..although the concept was to be of squares and I can clearly see circles as well. Very creative.</td>', 'Good subject. ..although the concept was to be of squares and I can clearly see circles as well. Very creative.', '2003-01-30 14:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(203804, 11462, 6450, '<td valign="top">good subject, what is it???</td>', 'good subject, what is it???', '2003-01-30 14:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(203805, 11640, 6481, '<td valign="top">This picture is too dark. I like the texture in the photo.</td>', 'This picture is too dark. I like the texture in the photo.', '2003-01-30 14:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(203806, 11500, 6454, '<td valign="top">I think that this picture was very intresting. I think by actualy using blocks in real life instead of on the computer would help you on creating in trest. Because on this picture i think that the intrest was taken away by having  it done by the computer. Nice Work</td>', 'I think that this picture was very intresting. I think by actualy using blocks in real life instead of on the computer would help you on creating in trest. Because on this picture i think that the intrest was taken away by having  it done by the computer. Nice Work', '2003-01-30 14:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(203807, 11597, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good<br/>Technical: Maybe slightly too dark at bottom?  Would have made border corners square too, rather than chamfered.  (Rectangle with Stroke in PS?)<br/>Meets challenge: Yes, and very nice too<br/>Overall impression: Really nice pic, lighting lets it down slightly, for me.  8</td>', 'Composition: GoodTechnical: Maybe slightly too dark at bottom?  Would have made border corners square too, rather than chamfered.  (Rectangle with Stroke in PS?)Meets challenge: Yes, and very nice tooOverall impression: Really nice pic, lighting lets it down slightly, for me.  8', '2003-01-30 14:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(203808, 11386, 6481, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this photo. The lines give it depth.</td>', 'I like the colors in this photo. The lines give it depth.', '2003-01-30 14:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(203809, 11382, 543, '<td valign="top">Clean, sharp, well lit, great tones and reflections plus multiple levels of meaning.  Nice.  The only fly in the jam, IMO, is the somewhat static centered composition.</td>', 'Clean, sharp, well lit, great tones and reflections plus multiple levels of meaning.  Nice.  The only fly in the jam, IMO, is the somewhat static centered composition.', '2003-01-30 14:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(203811, 11438, 4815, '<td valign="top">Fantastic foto!!! Very original concept which deserves extra points in its own right. The unusual pose, contrast of hairy legs with the rounded shading of arms, the crossed wrists, wrinkled cloth backdrop are particularly outstanding visual elements. B&amp;W was undoubtably the wisest choice. Beautiful rendered tones and minute detail. Gets a 9 vote from me... and certainly worthy of at least that from many others. Excellent work!!!</td>', 'Fantastic foto!!! Very original concept which deserves extra points in its own right. The unusual pose, contrast of hairy legs with the rounded shading of arms, the crossed wrists, wrinkled cloth backdrop are particularly outstanding visual elements. B&W was undoubtably the wisest choice. Beautiful rendered tones and minute detail. Gets a 9 vote from me... and certainly worthy of at least that from many others. Excellent work!!!', '2003-01-30 14:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(203812, 11411, 6481, '<td valign="top">This photo is too busy.</td>', 'This photo is too busy.', '2003-01-30 14:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(203813, 11556, 6454, '<td valign="top">I think by having this picture done without real color made this image much more creative. Try to move in just a little closer to the picture to make a little more intrest. Nice Work</td>', 'I think by having this picture done without real color made this image much more creative. Try to move in just a little closer to the picture to make a little more intrest. Nice Work', '2003-01-30 14:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(203814, 11571, 6451, '<td valign="top">I like the shadows in the photo, and the concept of something old and worn. The rusting adds nice color.  I think that maybe this wasn''t the best idea for photographing something square. Be more creative.</td>', 'I like the shadows in the photo, and the concept of something old and worn. The rusting adds nice color.  I think that maybe this wasn''t the best idea for photographing something square. Be more creative.', '2003-01-30 14:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(203815, 11456, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice ''n'' crunchy tones.</td>', 'Nice ''n'' crunchy tones.', '2003-01-30 14:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(203816, 11520, 6481, '<td valign="top">I love the shadows in this photo. They move your eyes along the house.</td>', 'I love the shadows in this photo. They move your eyes along the house.', '2003-01-30 14:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(203817, 11597, 6481, '<td valign="top">What is the subject of this photo. I like the contrast of light and dark.</td>', 'What is the subject of this photo. I like the contrast of light and dark.', '2003-01-30 14:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(203818, 11627, 6454, '<td valign="top">I think that the color in this picture turned out very nice. I think that if this picture was done in black and white it would having given the picture more intres. Also by moveing away more creates more intrest. Nice Work</td>', 'I think that the color in this picture turned out very nice. I think that if this picture was done in black and white it would having given the picture more intres. Also by moveing away more creates more intrest. Nice Work', '2003-01-30 14:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(203819, 11597, 543, '<td valign="top">I hope this is doing better than I''m afraid it is (if that makes any sense).  I esp. like the lighitng on your background.  Very fine.</td>', 'I hope this is doing better than I''m afraid it is (if that makes any sense).  I esp. like the lighitng on your background.  Very fine.', '2003-01-30 14:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(203820, 11591, 543, '<td valign="top">Did you try this in a vertical orientation, maybe without the boxes at R?  Not seeing any of the boxes in full gives this image a very cramped, cluttered feel.  The lighing is odd, too.  the three boxes in the background (L) are better lit than the one up front.  I see what you were aiming for, I think, but I don''t think this is quite it.</td>', 'Did you try this in a vertical orientation, maybe without the boxes at R?  Not seeing any of the boxes in full gives this image a very cramped, cluttered feel.  The lighing is odd, too.  the three boxes in the background (L) are better lit than the one up front.  I see what you were aiming for, I think, but I don''t think this is quite it.', '2003-01-30 14:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(203824, 11502, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good<br/>Technical: Good focus.  Little dark and ''flat''?<br/>Meets challenge: Very well<br/>Overall impression: Nice pic, but slightly lacking interest?  6</td>', 'Composition: GoodTechnical: Good focus.  Little dark and ''flat''?Meets challenge: Very wellOverall impression: Nice pic, but slightly lacking interest?  6', '2003-01-30 14:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(203825, 11501, 4815, '<td valign="top">This is among my favorite three images for this week.  Thank you for daring to venture into candid informal territory. Absolutely wonderful personable family mood. A priceless moment that to me blows away any studio shot here. This image has real value and staying power to me. It brings out the longings of childhood and rekindles family memories.  A very powerful emotional image that should strike a heart chord in everyone. Even if the photo was dismal technically I still would rate it high because of its extraordinary moment of casual humanity. But the foto is very competent by all other photographic measures, too. Focus, exposure, choice of B&amp;W, tonal rendition, composition, you name it...near perfection in a nutshell. I really really love the feel of roundness and contours in the skin tones and their contrast to the water ripples and tub. You should be very pleased with this photoghaph no matter what the rating. No master photographer could do better. Hope many others rave madly about the foto too. Good luck</td>', 'This is among my favorite three images for this week.  Thank you for daring to venture into candid informal territory. Absolutely wonderful personable family mood. A priceless moment that to me blows away any studio shot here. This image has real value and staying power to me. It brings out the longings of childhood and rekindles family memories.  A very powerful emotional image that should strike a heart chord in everyone. Even if the photo was dismal technically I still would rate it high because of its extraordinary moment of casual humanity. But the foto is very competent by all other photographic measures, too. Focus, exposure, choice of B&W, tonal rendition, composition, you name it...near perfection in a nutshell. I really really love the feel of roundness and contours in the skin tones and their contrast to the water ripples and tub. You should be very pleased with this photoghaph no matter what the rating. No master photographer could do better. Hope many others rave madly about the foto too. Good luck', '2003-01-30 14:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(203826, 11529, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good, but bottom-left circle is slightly further in?<br/>Technical: Nice lighting and colour.  Slightly noisy though?<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Very interesting abstract, but above lets it down a little.  7</td>', 'Composition: Good, but bottom-left circle is slightly further in?Technical: Nice lighting and colour.  Slightly noisy though?Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Very interesting abstract, but above lets it down a little.  7', '2003-01-30 14:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
