(203917, 11630, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love the old building shots.  The branch in front of the window adds character.  Thank you for doing it in color.  If I had a complaint it would be that I would like the red brick to show just a little more to frame the window a little better.  But that''s not really a complaint, just a personal thought.  It''s a beautiful well done photo.</td>', 'I love the old building shots.  The branch in front of the window adds character.  Thank you for doing it in color.  If I had a complaint it would be that I would like the red brick to show just a little more to frame the window a little better.  But that''s not really a complaint, just a personal thought.  It''s a beautiful well done photo.', '2003-01-30 16:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(203918, 11567, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I really like the color.  Although, I think that these blocks look more like rectangles than squares. It could also be a bit more creative.  Nice job.</td>', 'Nice photo. I really like the color.  Although, I think that these blocks look more like rectangles than squares. It could also be a bit more creative.  Nice job.', '2003-01-30 16:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
