(203921, 11520, 4648, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhh.  The beauty of the old buildings.  I love it.  I''m so glad you did it in color also.  That beautiful blue sky against the rool line is georgeous.  I love the shadows of the tree limbs, they add mystic to the photo.  Looks like someone might have started to fix it up, and gave up.  There''s a story here.  Really great photo.  Love it.</td>', 'Ahhhhh.  The beauty of the old buildings.  I love it.  I''m so glad you did it in color also.  That beautiful blue sky against the rool line is georgeous.  I love the shadows of the tree limbs, they add mystic to the photo.  Looks like someone might have started to fix it up, and gave up.  There''s a story here.  Really great photo.  Love it.', '2003-01-30 16:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(203922, 11484, 6451, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the background setting of the photo.  I do feel that it needs something more.  It seems a little plain.  The black and white adds a nice touch.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like the color and the background setting of the photo.  I do feel that it needs something more.  It seems a little plain.  The black and white adds a nice touch.  Nice job.', '2003-01-30 16:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(203927, 11467, 4648, '<td valign="top">It''s too dark for me to tell a whole lot about it.  I know what you are doing but I just can''t quite see it.  I do like how the green table fades into the black background.  Awesome photo, just personally would like it a little lighter.</td>', 'It''s too dark for me to tell a whole lot about it.  I know what you are doing but I just can''t quite see it.  I do like how the green table fades into the black background.  Awesome photo, just personally would like it a little lighter.', '2003-01-30 16:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(203928, 11473, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great composition and well executed.  The border adds to this photo.  If it weren''t for the right hand sitting on the box it would look like a real person.  Great job.   Lovely colors.  It''s a 9 for sure.</td>', 'Great composition and well executed.  The border adds to this photo.  If it weren''t for the right hand sitting on the box it would look like a real person.  Great job.   Lovely colors.  It''s a 9 for sure.', '2003-01-30 16:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(203929, 11369, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful building with great reflections.  I love the color of the building.  Could you have pulled back a little and let us see a little more without messing up what you were trying to show?  I love the waves in the reflection.  Great photo with really good execution.</td>', 'Beautiful building with great reflections.  I love the color of the building.  Could you have pulled back a little and let us see a little more without messing up what you were trying to show?  I love the waves in the reflection.  Great photo with really good execution.', '2003-01-30 17:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(203930, 11556, 4648, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is.  I gather it''s electronic in nature.  But I do feel all of it should have been in focus with only the background out of focus.  I do like the tone of the photo.  Not a bad photo, just need better execution.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is.  I gather it''s electronic in nature.  But I do feel all of it should have been in focus with only the background out of focus.  I do like the tone of the photo.  Not a bad photo, just need better execution.', '2003-01-30 17:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(203931, 11551, 4648, '<td valign="top">I want to know how they got a car in that one garage with the tree growing there?.  It must have been "unused" for quite some time.  This is a really nice photo.  I started to say the closed door was out of focus a little, but after looking closer I think it''s just the shadows that make it look that way.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I want to know how they got a car in that one garage with the tree growing there?.  It must have been "unused" for quite some time.  This is a really nice photo.  I started to say the closed door was out of focus a little, but after looking closer I think it''s just the shadows that make it look that way.  Nicely done.', '2003-01-30 17:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(203933, 11560, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tower.  The light is good and the cropping is ok.  The focus appears to be a bit soft, especially on the clock itself.  It seems to loose focus as you go up the tower.  The bottom appears to be ok.  Nice shot, just need a little better execution.</td>', 'Beautiful tower.  The light is good and the cropping is ok.  The focus appears to be a bit soft, especially on the clock itself.  It seems to loose focus as you go up the tower.  The bottom appears to be ok.  Nice shot, just need a little better execution.', '2003-01-30 17:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(203935, 11484, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Good focus with nice cropping.  I like the sepia tone here.  But what in the world is this and where is it.  I hope you tell us.  It sure fits the challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Good focus with nice cropping.  I like the sepia tone here.  But what in the world is this and where is it.  I hope you tell us.  It sure fits the challenge.', '2003-01-30 17:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(203937, 11562, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love the photo but I don''t like the cropping.  I don''t see any reasoning for cutting your subject in half and leaving the pavement.  Rule of thirds here works against you in my opinion.  Other wise it''s a really nice photo with good focus and all.</td>', 'I love the photo but I don''t like the cropping.  I don''t see any reasoning for cutting your subject in half and leaving the pavement.  Rule of thirds here works against you in my opinion.  Other wise it''s a really nice photo with good focus and all.', '2003-01-30 17:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
