(204049, 11386, 811, '<td valign="top">They are mad alright.  That lightest green/yellow strip really begs for attention.  I am interesting in knowing why you choose two shades of green.  I think if the bottom one had been more yellow it would have been better.  The frames pull you into the picture I think.</td>', 'They are mad alright.  That lightest green/yellow strip really begs for attention.  I am interesting in knowing why you choose two shades of green.  I think if the bottom one had been more yellow it would have been better.  The frames pull you into the picture I think.', '2003-01-30 22:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(204050, 11560, 811, '<td valign="top">I am seeing some noise in the sky part of your picture, and I suspect that could cause the tower to look slightly out of focus.  If you haven''t used it, NEATIMAGE does a wonderful job with noise in a photo.</td>', 'I am seeing some noise in the sky part of your picture, and I suspect that could cause the tower to look slightly out of focus.  If you haven''t used it, NEATIMAGE does a wonderful job with noise in a photo.', '2003-01-30 22:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(204051, 11657, 811, '<td valign="top">A really sharp focus would have made these wonderfully contrasting colors really *pop* I think.</td>', 'A really sharp focus would have made these wonderfully contrasting colors really *pop* I think.', '2003-01-30 22:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(204052, 11531, 811, '<td valign="top">I think a little more light would have helped this shot not appear quite so "flat."  Also, maybe if the tile wasn''t centered quite so much.  In the middle like that, it makes the picture very static, though stable.</td>', 'I think a little more light would have helped this shot not appear quite so "flat."  Also, maybe if the tile wasn''t centered quite so much.  In the middle like that, it makes the picture very static, though stable.', '2003-01-30 22:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(204053, 11421, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenary.  Atfirst, I thought you might have needed to fill the frame more  with the "bird condo" but I like the inclusion of the trees -- it adds context.  Perhaps if it had been framed so that it was just the bird house and the tree immediately to the left of it, with the houses on the right third of the shot, it would have more dynamics about it.</td>', 'Beautiful scenary.  Atfirst, I thought you might have needed to fill the frame more  with the "bird condo" but I like the inclusion of the trees -- it adds context.  Perhaps if it had been framed so that it was just the bird house and the tree immediately to the left of it, with the houses on the right third of the shot, it would have more dynamics about it.', '2003-01-30 22:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(204054, 11564, 811, '<td valign="top">It is straight at the bottom, but not at the top.  That makes it feel kinda off balanced to me.  maybe a different perspective that showed the same thing would have made the picture more dynamic.</td>', 'It is straight at the bottom, but not at the top.  That makes it feel kinda off balanced to me.  maybe a different perspective that showed the same thing would have made the picture more dynamic.', '2003-01-30 22:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(204057, 11388, 811, '<td valign="top">I think you need either more blur showing definite motion, or less so that the picture is crystal clear.</td>', 'I think you need either more blur showing definite motion, or less so that the picture is crystal clear.', '2003-01-30 23:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(204059, 11432, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great focus and I really like the background.  Good job.</td>', 'Great focus and I really like the background.  Good job.', '2003-01-30 23:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(204061, 11456, 811, '<td valign="top">The contrast in this is nice, but it is lacking a something.  Perhaps if you had placed something round on it to highlight the squares even more through contrast.  Or placing something square on it.  Either way would have help add some depth, I think.</td>', 'The contrast in this is nice, but it is lacking a something.  Perhaps if you had placed something round on it to highlight the squares even more through contrast.  Or placing something square on it.  Either way would have help add some depth, I think.', '2003-01-30 23:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(204062, 11632, 811, '<td valign="top">I think some more contrast would ahve helped this picture be a bit more attention grabbing.  All of the colors are so similar and muted it seems kinda flat.</td>', 'I think some more contrast would ahve helped this picture be a bit more attention grabbing.  All of the colors are so similar and muted it seems kinda flat.', '2003-01-30 23:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(204063, 11361, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the lighting, it seems to need more file size though.</td>', 'Nice job on the lighting, it seems to need more file size though.', '2003-01-30 23:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(204064, 11585, 811, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the red and green works well.  I think it may be just a tad dark though.  Those colors, with a little more light, could be awesomely vivid, I think.</td>', 'The contrast between the red and green works well.  I think it may be just a tad dark though.  Those colors, with a little more light, could be awesomely vivid, I think.', '2003-01-30 23:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(204065, 11375, 3280, '<td valign="top">Looks like this would be a nice shot for the Before and After challenge.  Interesting shot.</td>', 'Looks like this would be a nice shot for the Before and After challenge.  Interesting shot.', '2003-01-30 23:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(204066, 11392, 811, '<td valign="top">Good use of colors.  The composition seems a little off to me.  I think it either needs to be centered more, or more in the right of the frame so that soem of the cases are "hanging" off.</td>', 'Good use of colors.  The composition seems a little off to me.  I think it either needs to be centered more, or more in the right of the frame so that soem of the cases are "hanging" off.', '2003-01-30 23:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(204068, 11497, 3280, '<td valign="top">I love old buildings like this.  Nice take on the challenge.  The glare at the top is a bit of a distraction.  Good color.</td>', 'I love old buildings like this.  Nice take on the challenge.  The glare at the top is a bit of a distraction.  Good color.', '2003-01-30 23:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(204069, 11538, 3280, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, I like it. I wonder what this would have looked like showing more of the reflection.</td>', 'Interesting shot, I like it. I wonder what this would have looked like showing more of the reflection.', '2003-01-30 23:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(204070, 11613, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great macro of the Triscuit.  I think it may have worked better at an angle.  I think the border takes away from the subject.</td>', 'Great macro of the Triscuit.  I think it may have worked better at an angle.  I think the border takes away from the subject.', '2003-01-30 23:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(204071, 11620, 811, '<td valign="top">Having the four corner cheeries slighly brighter than the rest works well I think.  For me though, I would have liked to see it with them all very bright and vivid, adn not quite so contrasty.</td>', 'Having the four corner cheeries slighly brighter than the rest works well I think.  For me though, I would have liked to see it with them all very bright and vivid, adn not quite so contrasty.', '2003-01-30 23:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(204072, 11592, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field here, and the simplicity of hte colors.  It is just a bit too much contrast, I think, though</td>', 'I like the depth of field here, and the simplicity of hte colors.  It is just a bit too much contrast, I think, though', '2003-01-30 23:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(204073, 11480, 811, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful looking, adn pleasant.  I think the composition could have been made stronger if you had  cropped part of the bottom of the candle holder and allowed more room at top.  It just feels crowded up there to me.</td>', 'Very peaceful looking, adn pleasant.  I think the composition could have been made stronger if you had  cropped part of the bottom of the candle holder and allowed more room at top.  It just feels crowded up there to me.', '2003-01-30 23:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(204074, 11658, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome focus and colors.  I think if the frame were moved a little more to the left, so that there wasn''t such a vast expanse on the right, it would have even more interest to  it.</td>', 'Awesome focus and colors.  I think if the frame were moved a little more to the left, so that there wasn''t such a vast expanse on the right, it would have even more interest to  it.', '2003-01-30 23:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(204076, 11581, 811, '<td valign="top">Great focus, and use of depth of fiels.  I love the dramatic angle, and the soft, though bright, colors.  Wonderful.  Hope you made enough for all of us!!!!</td>', 'Great focus, and use of depth of fiels.  I love the dramatic angle, and the soft, though bright, colors.  Wonderful.  Hope you made enough for all of us!!!!', '2003-01-30 23:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(204077, 11410, 811, '<td valign="top">The emotion showing on her face really makes an impact behind the "squares''.  Excellent shot, and good use of bw.</td>', 'The emotion showing on her face really makes an impact behind the "squares''.  Excellent shot, and good use of bw.', '2003-01-30 23:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(204078, 11608, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition, the thingy-ma-bobby caliper really adds interest and dynamics to this shot.</td>', 'Great composition, the thingy-ma-bobby caliper really adds interest and dynamics to this shot.', '2003-01-30 23:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(204079, 11356, 811, '<td valign="top">Very elegant (bw) and graceful (curve fo the bubbles/balls).  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very elegant (bw) and graceful (curve fo the bubbles/balls).  Nicely done.', '2003-01-30 23:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(204080, 11550, 811, '<td valign="top">Ewww.  I sure hope that is an intake and not an out vent.  Great detail captured and wonderful focus.</td>', 'Ewww.  I sure hope that is an intake and not an out vent.  Great detail captured and wonderful focus.', '2003-01-30 23:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(204081, 11583, 811, '<td valign="top">Great focus.  If I were being nit-picky (and obvioulsy I am),  maybe you should have gotten rid of the crumbs scattered here and there  Wonderful shot, and I think I will go grab some right now!  <br/>PS -- I vote for the sugar side!</td>', 'Great focus.  If I were being nit-picky (and obvioulsy I am),  maybe you should have gotten rid of the crumbs scattered here and there  Wonderful shot, and I think I will go grab some right now!  PS -- I vote for the sugar side!', '2003-01-30 23:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(204082, 11617, 811, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t care for abstracts, but yours is an exception.  This is a wonderful combination of contrasting colors, and it is a very effective use of negative space I think.</td>', 'I normally don''t care for abstracts, but yours is an exception.  This is a wonderful combination of contrasting colors, and it is a very effective use of negative space I think.', '2003-01-30 23:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(204083, 11646, 811, '<td valign="top">Great colors and use of symmetry.  The angle also helps give the picture "motion" and dynamics.</td>', 'Great colors and use of symmetry.  The angle also helps give the picture "motion" and dynamics.', '2003-01-30 23:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(204084, 11359, 811, '<td valign="top">A wonderful sky, and I like the repeating pattern of the fence.  The fence seems a touch out of focus though, I think sharper would be really cool, and you probably should have cropped the building out of the bottom.</td>', 'A wonderful sky, and I like the repeating pattern of the fence.  The fence seems a touch out of focus though, I think sharper would be really cool, and you probably should have cropped the building out of the bottom.', '2003-01-30 23:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(204085, 11440, 811, '<td valign="top">I feel like i am with the Alligator Hunter on a mission to find wild snow men. Great use of the weeds or whatever in the foreground.  Also, congrats on getting your snow mostly white and not blown out or blue!</td>', 'I feel like i am with the Alligator Hunter on a mission to find wild snow men. Great use of the weeds or whatever in the foreground.  Also, congrats on getting your snow mostly white and not blown out or blue!', '2003-01-30 23:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(204089, 11427, 2182, '<td valign="top">This color is really something</td>', 'This color is really something', '2003-01-31 00:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(204094, 11572, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  I think the lighting is a bit too High Key.  This was a great idea though.  I like your style.</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  I think the lighting is a bit too High Key.  This was a great idea though.  I like your style.', '2003-01-31 00:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(204097, 11569, 3959, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of this week''s challenge. Very clever indeed and well thought out. wonderfully placed inside the frame as well. That''s really thinking outside the box (or perhaps insdie the box, in this case). Good going.</td>', 'This is my favorite of this week''s challenge. Very clever indeed and well thought out. wonderfully placed inside the frame as well. That''s really thinking outside the box (or perhaps insdie the box, in this case). Good going.', '2003-01-31 00:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(204099, 11391, 4514, '<td valign="top">Very Nice.  :-)  I like this shot.  Good contrast.  :-)</td>', 'Very Nice.  :-)  I like this shot.  Good contrast.  :-)', '2003-01-31 01:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(204100, 11582, 4514, '<td valign="top">Something seems to be wrong with the light.  I can not put my finger on it.  What does your histogram say about it???</td>', 'Something seems to be wrong with the light.  I can not put my finger on it.  What does your histogram say about it???', '2003-01-31 01:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(204101, 11436, 4514, '<td valign="top">Very sharp.  This is one of the better shots in my oppinion.</td>', 'Very sharp.  This is one of the better shots in my oppinion.', '2003-01-31 01:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(204102, 11446, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is a good contrast shot.  Lighting was just right.</td>', 'This is a good contrast shot.  Lighting was just right.', '2003-01-31 01:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(204103, 11601, 2011, '<td valign="top">Good one!  I really like all of this. : )   10</td>', 'Good one!  I really like all of this. : )   10', '2003-01-31 01:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(204111, 11658, 3084, '<td valign="top">Wonderful work.  I really like the pattern, light, and angles.  It would have been even better if the perspective was properly aligned</td>', 'Wonderful work.  I really like the pattern, light, and angles.  It would have been even better if the perspective was properly aligned', '2003-01-31 05:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(204112, 11534, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Wonderful colours and symmetry.</td>', 'Great idea.  Wonderful colours and symmetry.', '2003-01-31 05:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(204114, 11597, 3084, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  Great symmetry, however, I would have preferred to see it in colour.</td>', 'Wonderful image.  Great symmetry, however, I would have preferred to see it in colour.', '2003-01-31 05:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(204115, 11569, 3084, '<td valign="top">I really like the juxtaposition of the angles which is what makes this image work so well.  And the lighting is excellent too.  Interesting framing (I do not mean the border) and composition as well.</td>', 'I really like the juxtaposition of the angles which is what makes this image work so well.  And the lighting is excellent too.  Interesting framing (I do not mean the border) and composition as well.', '2003-01-31 05:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(204122, 11582, 4615, '<td valign="top">great idea to meet challenge.  to improve, increase the amount of light used.</td>', 'great idea to meet challenge.  to improve, increase the amount of light used.', '2003-01-31 08:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(204123, 11596, 4615, '<td valign="top">I love the layered effect of the reflection.</td>', 'I love the layered effect of the reflection.', '2003-01-31 08:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(204126, 11608, 4615, '<td valign="top">point well taken-answers the debate in the forums!</td>', 'point well taken-answers the debate in the forums!', '2003-01-31 08:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(204127, 11382, 4615, '<td valign="top">okay, that''ll shut the nit pickers up...</td>', 'okay, that''ll shut the nit pickers up...', '2003-01-31 08:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(204131, 11415, 4615, '<td valign="top">off subject.  (just kidding)<br/>Good focus, a little too bright.</td>', 'off subject.  (just kidding)Good focus, a little too bright.', '2003-01-31 08:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(204133, 11664, 4340, '<td valign="top">my fav this week.  very beautiful and geometric</td>', 'my fav this week.  very beautiful and geometric', '2003-01-31 08:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(204142, 11356, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.. the black and white really makes it ''pop'' for me.. kudos = 10 - setzler</td>', 'This is a great shot.. the black and white really makes it ''pop'' for me.. kudos = 10 - setzler', '2003-01-31 09:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(204143, 11427, 772, '<td valign="top">very simple and elegant design... the background color really makes this shot work well = 10 - setzler</td>', 'very simple and elegant design... the background color really makes this shot work well = 10 - setzler', '2003-01-31 09:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(204169, 11658, 2764, '<td valign="top">Is this a building or a showerstall?  I like that there is no frame of reference.</td>', 'Is this a building or a showerstall?  I like that there is no frame of reference.', '2003-01-31 10:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(204170, 11533, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is my pick to win and my only ten this week!  Great set up, lovely composition.</td>', 'This is my pick to win and my only ten this week!  Great set up, lovely composition.', '2003-01-31 10:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(204171, 11557, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is my second favorite this week!!  I love it.</td>', 'This is my second favorite this week!!  I love it.', '2003-01-31 10:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(204173, 11444, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is my third favorite this week.  Hope you get a ribbon.</td>', 'This is my third favorite this week.  Hope you get a ribbon.', '2003-01-31 10:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(204184, 11557, 6490, '<td valign="top">made me laugh</td>', 'made me laugh', '2003-01-31 11:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(204186, 11370, 4615, '<td valign="top">a little over saturated</td>', 'a little over saturated', '2003-01-31 11:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(204187, 11556, 6490, '<td valign="top">all pins should be in focus. the ones closer to the camera aren''t</td>', 'all pins should be in focus. the ones closer to the camera aren''t', '2003-01-31 11:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(204194, 11403, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice colors but the general subject here doesn''t have a lot of appeal to me. - Inspzil</td>', 'Nice colors but the general subject here doesn''t have a lot of appeal to me. - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 11:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(204195, 11382, 975, '<td valign="top">I really like how this pic is "true"ly square!  The color is great, and the contrast between the squares and the square (with the round windows and the round hole in the end) makes for a great subject. 10</td>', 'I really like how this pic is "true"ly square!  The color is great, and the contrast between the squares and the square (with the round windows and the round hole in the end) makes for a great subject. 10', '2003-01-31 11:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(204198, 11534, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Great idea.  The only thing about this pic that I don''t like is that its a little bright, but not overexposed by any means.  It looks a pinch oversharpened too.  Quality pic though - Inspzil</td>', 'Nice colors. Great idea.  The only thing about this pic that I don''t like is that its a little bright, but not overexposed by any means.  It looks a pinch oversharpened too.  Quality pic though - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 11:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(204201, 11590, 3540, '<td valign="top">All around this seems a little off (pardon the pun).  It just doesn''t seem square.  The paper could be more square than you left it actually.  Top of the paper looks like it might be a little washed out.  - Inspzil</td>', 'All around this seems a little off (pardon the pun).  It just doesn''t seem square.  The paper could be more square than you left it actually.  Top of the paper looks like it might be a little washed out.  - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 11:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(204202, 11532, 4615, '<td valign="top">great collection.</td>', 'great collection.', '2003-01-31 11:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(204203, 11581, 3540, '<td valign="top">Pretty good idea.  I question cutting the apples up when showing them with the carmel and sticks.  We never put cut apples on sticks, just whole ones.  It makes only a little difference though.  I think a higher aperture would have been more appropriate so that the DOF was a little greater.  - Inspzil</td>', 'Pretty good idea.  I question cutting the apples up when showing them with the carmel and sticks.  We never put cut apples on sticks, just whole ones.  It makes only a little difference though.  I think a higher aperture would have been more appropriate so that the DOF was a little greater.  - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 11:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(204207, 11452, 3540, '<td valign="top">Rich folks?  Nice cam.  Hate saying that it could be a little crisper.  It is a Nikon you know.  This isn''t really doing it for me though.  Sorry - Inspzil</td>', 'Rich folks?  Nice cam.  Hate saying that it could be a little crisper.  It is a Nikon you know.  This isn''t really doing it for me though.  Sorry - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 11:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(204210, 11598, 3540, '<td valign="top">This pic appears grainy.  Nice choice of subject and arrangement.  The lighting off the metal parts in the middle is a little bright though.  - Inspzil</td>', 'This pic appears grainy.  Nice choice of subject and arrangement.  The lighting off the metal parts in the middle is a little bright though.  - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 11:52:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(204212, 11558, 3540, '<td valign="top">The sun above the building is hurting this shot.  It''s very well taken, but I''m not wild about the composition.  There really needs to be some focal point to this pic.   - Inspzil</td>', 'The sun above the building is hurting this shot.  It''s very well taken, but I''m not wild about the composition.  There really needs to be some focal point to this pic.   - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 11:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(204214, 11521, 3540, '<td valign="top">Too much square stuff I think.  The dice are enough.  Its making this picture very cluttered - Inspzil</td>', 'Too much square stuff I think.  The dice are enough.  Its making this picture very cluttered - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 11:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(204215, 11597, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The color tone suits this pic very well - Nice job - Inspzil</td>', 'Nice idea.  The color tone suits this pic very well - Nice job - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 11:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(204216, 11424, 3540, '<td valign="top">Like a picture out of a Biology textbook.  Like the reddish background too.  Great shot - Inspzil</td>', 'Like a picture out of a Biology textbook.  Like the reddish background too.  Great shot - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 12:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(204220, 11591, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Great horizontally.  Maybe a bit more of the subject (rather than reflection) vertically?<br/>Technical:  Spot on, although reflection is a little dark.  Possibly couldn''t improve this?<br/>Meets challenge: I was thinking ''No'' until I looked at the reflection.  Some may miss it I think.<br/>Overall impression: Everything there, but composition lets it down a bit.  6</td>', 'Composition: Great horizontally.  Maybe a bit more of the subject (rather than reflection) vertically?Technical:  Spot on, although reflection is a little dark.  Possibly couldn''t improve this?Meets challenge: I was thinking ''No'' until I looked at the reflection.  Some may miss it I think.Overall impression: Everything there, but composition lets it down a bit.  6', '2003-01-31 12:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(204221, 11438, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good<br/>Technical: Great.  Nice border colour/size.  Good pic size too.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression:  Can''t really fault the pic, but lacking slightly from the challenge point of view.  7</td>', 'Composition: GoodTechnical: Great.  Nice border colour/size.  Good pic size too.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression:  Can''t really fault the pic, but lacking slightly from the challenge point of view.  7', '2003-01-31 12:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(204222, 11667, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Excellent<br/>Technical: Excellent DOF.  Bottom-left a little dark?<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression:  The bottom-left darkness lets it down slightly from being a stunning pic.  8</td>', 'Composition: ExcellentTechnical: Excellent DOF.  Bottom-left a little dark?Meets challenge: YesOverall impression:  The bottom-left darkness lets it down slightly from being a stunning pic.  8', '2003-01-31 12:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
