(204425, 11599, 4815, '<td valign="top">Cool boxed in world concept. I like it. My sentiments exactly of crushed in urban crunch. The zing of red adds vibrant life ands nicely contrasts to the torment of vertical and horizontal elements. The brutal ominous shadows surely add to the claustrophobic feel. Excellent foto!</td>', 'Cool boxed in world concept. I like it. My sentiments exactly of crushed in urban crunch. The zing of red adds vibrant life ands nicely contrasts to the torment of vertical and horizontal elements. The brutal ominous shadows surely add to the claustrophobic feel. Excellent foto!', '2003-01-31 19:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(204426, 11356, 4815, '<td valign="top">Love the rhythm of the ball wave against the play of PS(?) squares. The B&amp;W is an excellent choice. No need to add color here as there is plenty of visual action happening. The balls are charming jewels of fascination in themselves. Good job.</td>', 'Love the rhythm of the ball wave against the play of PS(?) squares. The B&W is an excellent choice. No need to add color here as there is plenty of visual action happening. The balls are charming jewels of fascination in themselves. Good job.', '2003-01-31 20:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(204427, 11551, 4815, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of morning eyelids prior to coffee invigoration. The easy on the eyes tones jive well. I like your choice of tree lines and shadows to break up the rectangular nature of the shot. The dead leaves at the bottom add a pleasant softening touch to the chunky nature of the bricks. The bits of gray shingles and eaves shadow cap off the photo  nicely. A fairly worthy shot deeming additional positive remarks.</td>', 'Reminds me of morning eyelids prior to coffee invigoration. The easy on the eyes tones jive well. I like your choice of tree lines and shadows to break up the rectangular nature of the shot. The dead leaves at the bottom add a pleasant softening touch to the chunky nature of the bricks. The bits of gray shingles and eaves shadow cap off the photo  nicely. A fairly worthy shot deeming additional positive remarks.', '2003-01-31 20:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(204428, 11575, 4815, '<td valign="top">Holy zappola look at those colors Batman. Snap on the shades to take in all that ultra glo. Pretty intense hues countered by a mysterious dangling shadowed manbit. A big score for the intense graphic and suck your lungs clean dry of air color. Looks like a top 20 score this week to me. Let the drama unfold.</td>', 'Holy zappola look at those colors Batman. Snap on the shades to take in all that ultra glo. Pretty intense hues countered by a mysterious dangling shadowed manbit. A big score for the intense graphic and suck your lungs clean dry of air color. Looks like a top 20 score this week to me. Let the drama unfold.', '2003-01-31 20:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(204429, 11460, 4815, '<td valign="top">Whoa! What a huge effort to plan and execute this dazzling masterpiece.  You better be a top 3 winner for that alone. Technique is impeccable ( focus, composition, DOF, color rendition, lighting angle, etc). Personally I would like a little more silver feel to the cutlery. Some folks might like plain placemats as opposed to the razzle dazzle color. Just two minor quibbles easily ignored. Good luck on racking up the big score.</td>', 'Whoa! What a huge effort to plan and execute this dazzling masterpiece.  You better be a top 3 winner for that alone. Technique is impeccable ( focus, composition, DOF, color rendition, lighting angle, etc). Personally I would like a little more silver feel to the cutlery. Some folks might like plain placemats as opposed to the razzle dazzle color. Just two minor quibbles easily ignored. Good luck on racking up the big score.', '2003-01-31 20:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(204432, 11467, 4815, '<td valign="top">I like the presentation of floating in black space and the solid rock feel of the platform. Lots of dark shadows that are eating up edge bits. That may bother some but not me. The mysterious feel is way kool. The zap of red zings up the photo nicely. The mirrors are a great idea. Interesting portrayal of subject.</td>', 'I like the presentation of floating in black space and the solid rock feel of the platform. Lots of dark shadows that are eating up edge bits. That may bother some but not me. The mysterious feel is way kool. The zap of red zings up the photo nicely. The mirrors are a great idea. Interesting portrayal of subject.', '2003-01-31 20:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(204434, 11452, 4815, '<td valign="top">A minor hot highlight for nitpickers to banter about. Otherwise a good solid shot of the chosen subject. Fits the challenge. Clean ,simple ,cool. Your technique is down pat. Deserves a reasonable amount of positive attention from other voters. Good luck.</td>', 'A minor hot highlight for nitpickers to banter about. Otherwise a good solid shot of the chosen subject. Fits the challenge. Clean ,simple ,cool. Your technique is down pat. Deserves a reasonable amount of positive attention from other voters. Good luck.', '2003-01-31 20:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(204435, 11446, 4815, '<td valign="top">Wonderful texture of your box. I like the off kilter angle and the missing left side swallowed in black shadow.  Not your everyday ho hum composition. Good B&amp;W photo illustration. Honest solid accomplished ork.</td>', 'Wonderful texture of your box. I like the off kilter angle and the missing left side swallowed in black shadow.  Not your everyday ho hum composition. Good B&W photo illustration. Honest solid accomplished ork.', '2003-01-31 20:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(204437, 11373, 4815, '<td valign="top">The power and visual weight of the light panel dwarfing the figures in the gloomy room is a marvel. Almost like a light chasm bursting  through oppresion. A good strong photo with an unusual touch of the human element. The dark shadows and restrained hues are very efective.</td>', 'The power and visual weight of the light panel dwarfing the figures in the gloomy room is a marvel. Almost like a light chasm bursting  through oppresion. A good strong photo with an unusual touch of the human element. The dark shadows and restrained hues are very efective.', '2003-01-31 20:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
