(204510, 11575, 6172, '<td valign="top">You know, I really like this photo, I really do.  The colors are lovely and the ladder on the side gives a strange twist to the photo.  I can''t score it high because it has NO SQUARE anywhere in the photo.  The photo itself is square, and that is all.  I feel we have to stick to our challenge theme for the rules to mean anything at all.</td>', 'You know, I really like this photo, I really do.  The colors are lovely and the ladder on the side gives a strange twist to the photo.  I can''t score it high because it has NO SQUARE anywhere in the photo.  The photo itself is square, and that is all.  I feel we have to stick to our challenge theme for the rules to mean anything at all.', '2003-02-01 02:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(204511, 11429, 6172, '<td valign="top">funny! only you could get away with getting anything but a one on a shot in a "squares" photo contest with no square!</td>', 'funny! only you could get away with getting anything but a one on a shot in a "squares" photo contest with no square!', '2003-02-01 02:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(204512, 11424, 6172, '<td valign="top">Fine work, but no square, no good score.</td>', 'Fine work, but no square, no good score.', '2003-02-01 02:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(204513, 11630, 6172, '<td valign="top">Squared away?  What is the meaning of the title in relation to the photo?</td>', 'Squared away?  What is the meaning of the title in relation to the photo?', '2003-02-01 02:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(204514, 11476, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice blur on that car, and a humorous concept.  Yeah, it''s not very deep, but it''s funny.  You know, your version of Monopoly is quite different from ours!</td>', 'Nice blur on that car, and a humorous concept.  Yeah, it''s not very deep, but it''s funny.  You know, your version of Monopoly is quite different from ours!', '2003-02-01 02:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(204517, 11377, 6349, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  I would like to know how you got it to look like a pen and ink drawing.  That solid black on the left is the only thing that bothers me.  A great photo.  Makes me think of superman.</td>', 'Awesome shot.  I would like to know how you got it to look like a pen and ink drawing.  That solid black on the left is the only thing that bothers me.  A great photo.  Makes me think of superman.', '2003-02-01 03:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(204518, 11561, 1169, '<td valign="top">i think a wider DOF would''ve been better</td>', 'i think a wider DOF would''ve been better', '2003-02-01 03:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(204519, 11352, 1169, '<td valign="top">you should''ve reagranged the bottom line too,  5</td>', 'you should''ve reagranged the bottom line too,  5', '2003-02-01 03:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(204520, 11626, 1169, '<td valign="top">crop out the spacebar at the bottom, 5</td>', 'crop out the spacebar at the bottom, 5', '2003-02-01 03:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(204522, 11519, 1169, '<td valign="top">nice title...</td>', 'nice title...', '2003-02-01 04:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(204527, 11408, 3540, '<td valign="top">Maybe thinking outside the box doesn''t make for a good photo.   - Inspzil</td>', 'Maybe thinking outside the box doesn''t make for a good photo.   - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 04:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(204528, 11541, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  Different idea.  I''m not sold on it.  Well taken photo though - Inspzil</td>', 'Great colors.  Different idea.  I''m not sold on it.  Well taken photo though - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 04:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(204529, 11434, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.  The composition is not saying anything to me here.  That or it''s a very unusual die.  Would make games much less interesting. - Inspzil</td>', 'I don''t get it.  The composition is not saying anything to me here.  That or it''s a very unusual die.  Would make games much less interesting. - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 04:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(204531, 11640, 3540, '<td valign="top">Neat colors.  Reminds me of a tile pattern.  Cool center tile though.  - Inspzil</td>', 'Neat colors.  Reminds me of a tile pattern.  Cool center tile though.  - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 05:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(204532, 11438, 3540, '<td valign="top">Definitely creativity working here.  I never, never never would''ve thought of this.  On the other hand, not terribly appealing.  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'Definitely creativity working here.  I never, never never would''ve thought of this.  On the other hand, not terribly appealing.  Good luck - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 05:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(204533, 11599, 3540, '<td valign="top">This square is a great frame.  The picture beyond is not super exciting, but not bad by any means.  The large stones in the wall next to the opening are very cool.  Reminds me of an album cover or something.  Very well chosen and good job executing the shot - Inspzil</td>', 'This square is a great frame.  The picture beyond is not super exciting, but not bad by any means.  The large stones in the wall next to the opening are very cool.  Reminds me of an album cover or something.  Very well chosen and good job executing the shot - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 05:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(204534, 11575, 3540, '<td valign="top">This pic has some really really nice colors.  I''m not getting what I''m looking at on the right side.  Looks almost like a piece of an observation tower. - Inspzil</td>', 'This pic has some really really nice colors.  I''m not getting what I''m looking at on the right side.  Looks almost like a piece of an observation tower. - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 05:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(204535, 11460, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very well conceived and executed.  The square eggs are great.  They don''t have square yolks though.  Oh well, you can''t have everything.  Nice job!  - Inspzil</td>', 'Very well conceived and executed.  The square eggs are great.  They don''t have square yolks though.  Oh well, you can''t have everything.  Nice job!  - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 05:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(204536, 11581, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good<br/>Technical: Excellent DOF &amp; lighting.  Really nice size and lack of border.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Excellent pic.  8</td>', 'Composition: GoodTechnical: Excellent DOF & lighting.  Really nice size and lack of border.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Excellent pic.  8', '2003-02-01 05:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(204537, 11659, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Maybe would have zoomed in on the square part more.<br/>Technical: Nice focus, colour and contrast.  Texture of the wood looks great.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Really nice and hard to fault.  7</td>', 'Composition: Maybe would have zoomed in on the square part more.Technical: Nice focus, colour and contrast.  Texture of the wood looks great.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Really nice and hard to fault.  7', '2003-02-01 05:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(204538, 11633, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good, although the dark reflect on the left seems to throw the pic out of balance a little<br/>Technical: Good focus and colour. Good size.  May have chosen a thin border, but maybe that looked bad with the window frames..<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Good choice of shot, but would have preferred a different angle I think.  6</td>', 'Composition: Good, although the dark reflect on the left seems to throw the pic out of balance a littleTechnical: Good focus and colour. Good size.  May have chosen a thin border, but maybe that looked bad with the window frames..Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Good choice of shot, but would have preferred a different angle I think.  6', '2003-02-01 05:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(204539, 11597, 1829, '<td valign="top">Beautiful interesting work here.   The composition is very eye catching and the framing suits your image.  I really like the square reflecting off your subject.  Excellent work and very creative :) 9</td>', 'Beautiful interesting work here.   The composition is very eye catching and the framing suits your image.  I really like the square reflecting off your subject.  Excellent work and very creative :) 9', '2003-02-01 05:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(204540, 11657, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good<br/>Technical: I think lack of light could have let this down, but you pulled it off nicely.  Focus seems slightly off apart from the bottom-right ball.<br/>Meets challenge: Pushing it a bit.<br/>Overall impression: Nice shot, good tech, but challenge criteria lets it down.  6</td>', 'Composition: GoodTechnical: I think lack of light could have let this down, but you pulled it off nicely.  Focus seems slightly off apart from the bottom-right ball.Meets challenge: Pushing it a bit.Overall impression: Nice shot, good tech, but challenge criteria lets it down.  6', '2003-02-01 05:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(204541, 11607, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Excellent.  As soon as I saw this pic I turned my head 45 degrees to try and work out what they are.<br/>Technical: Excellent.  Not completely sure about the orange background.  Maybe a darker colour?<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression:  I love interesting photos, and you''ve got this one pretty spot on.  9</td>', 'Composition: Excellent.  As soon as I saw this pic I turned my head 45 degrees to try and work out what they are.Technical: Excellent.  Not completely sure about the orange background.  Maybe a darker colour?Meets challenge: YesOverall impression:  I love interesting photos, and you''ve got this one pretty spot on.  9', '2003-02-01 05:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(204542, 11542, 1829, '<td valign="top">I love the colours against the black background.  Excellent composition.  I really like how you have arranged the pencils with the lines of them going in the one direction.  Also the cube breaks up the lines which you have used (pencils).  The lighting is excellent but imo the dark spot on the lower left kind of drags my eye down there.  However an excellent, creative shot.  This certainly meets this weeks challenge.  GL :)   9</td>', 'I love the colours against the black background.  Excellent composition.  I really like how you have arranged the pencils with the lines of them going in the one direction.  Also the cube breaks up the lines which you have used (pencils).  The lighting is excellent but imo the dark spot on the lower left kind of drags my eye down there.  However an excellent, creative shot.  This certainly meets this weeks challenge.  GL :)   9', '2003-02-01 05:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(204543, 11634, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good.  Would have been tempted to centralise the letters horz (less space near E).<br/>Technical: Good colour and lighting.  Focus seems slightly off around R and E?  Seems slightly noisy?<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Focus lets it down slightly, but otherwise, great pic.  7</td>', 'Composition: Good.  Would have been tempted to centralise the letters horz (less space near E).Technical: Good colour and lighting.  Focus seems slightly off around R and E?  Seems slightly noisy?Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Focus lets it down slightly, but otherwise, great pic.  7', '2003-02-01 05:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(204544, 11410, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of subject.  Very creative indeed.  The little girl adds interest for the ''background'' as well.  Lighting, composition and the slight dof is wonderful.  Just a tad blown out on her left cheek, otherwise a beautiful image.  I really like how you have use b&amp;w for this image.  GL  :) 8</td>', 'Excellent choice of subject.  Very creative indeed.  The little girl adds interest for the ''background'' as well.  Lighting, composition and the slight dof is wonderful.  Just a tad blown out on her left cheek, otherwise a beautiful image.  I really like how you have use b&w for this image.  GL  :) 8', '2003-02-01 05:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(204545, 11587, 1829, '<td valign="top">Very, very creative image.  Clarity, lighting and composition are just excellent.  Where did you manage to find all those ''square'' items?....lol.  Excellent work and GL :) 8</td>', 'Very, very creative image.  Clarity, lighting and composition are just excellent.  Where did you manage to find all those ''square'' items?....lol.  Excellent work and GL :) 8', '2003-02-01 05:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(204546, 11428, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition:  Good<br/>Technical: Slightly noisy.  Right-hand pieces seem a little dark?  Would possibly have chosen a slightly less vibrant coloured piece to fit in with the pic.<br/>Meets challenge: This looks like it has been edited with a brush/etc, which is a BIG no no.  <br/>Overall impression: Could have been really nice, but lacking on the above points.  Without spot editing: 5, With: 0.</td>', 'Composition:  GoodTechnical: Slightly noisy.  Right-hand pieces seem a little dark?  Would possibly have chosen a slightly less vibrant coloured piece to fit in with the pic.Meets challenge: This looks like it has been edited with a brush/etc, which is a BIG no no.  Overall impression: Could have been really nice, but lacking on the above points.  Without spot editing: 5, With: 0.', '2003-02-01 05:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(204547, 11619, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Great<br/>Technical: Excellent focus and lighting/shadow.  Pic seems slightly dark?  Good choice of border.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Really good, but would have preferred it slightly lighter personally.  7</td>', 'Composition: GreatTechnical: Excellent focus and lighting/shadow.  Pic seems slightly dark?  Good choice of border.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Really good, but would have preferred it slightly lighter personally.  7', '2003-02-01 05:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(204548, 11599, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Excellent<br/>Technical: Great focus.  Maybe slightly dark, but I don''t think it''s detrimental to the pic.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Nice idea and shot, good tech.  8</td>', 'Composition: ExcellentTechnical: Great focus.  Maybe slightly dark, but I don''t think it''s detrimental to the pic.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Nice idea and shot, good tech.  8', '2003-02-01 05:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(204549, 11647, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good.  Really like the background and table surface<br/>Technical: Fantastic focus, good use of colour, nice border.  Looks like you''ve sharpened after you added the border not before (white line between pic and border).  Best to do it before added the border.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Technically great and aesthetic too!  8</td>', 'Composition: Good.  Really like the background and table surfaceTechnical: Fantastic focus, good use of colour, nice border.  Looks like you''ve sharpened after you added the border not before (white line between pic and border).  Best to do it before added the border.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Technically great and aesthetic too!  8', '2003-02-01 05:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(204550, 11354, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good<br/>Technical: The focus seems good, but this pic is very dark for me.  I can''t tell what the subject is bottom-right, which I assume I should be able to.<br/>Meets challenge: Push it a little..<br/>Overall impression: With more contrast could have been much better.  4</td>', 'Composition: GoodTechnical: The focus seems good, but this pic is very dark for me.  I can''t tell what the subject is bottom-right, which I assume I should be able to.Meets challenge: Push it a little..Overall impression: With more contrast could have been much better.  4', '2003-02-01 06:01:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(204551, 11664, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition:  Great.  Can''t help but wonder what an off-centre crop would look like..<br/>Technical: Excellent focus, contrast and lighting (didn''t see Windows &amp; Doors submission)<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression:  One of those pics you just keep looking at.  8</td>', 'Composition:  Great.  Can''t help but wonder what an off-centre crop would look like..Technical: Excellent focus, contrast and lighting (didn''t see Windows & Doors submission)Meets challenge: YesOverall impression:  One of those pics you just keep looking at.  8', '2003-02-01 06:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(204552, 11481, 3900, '<td valign="top">Check out //www.m-w.com to spell "imminent" correctly, and then check out //www.neatimage.com/  and download Neat Image to get rid of all that noise; it works wonders.  Besides that, the black piece blends into the background so i can''t tell what it is.  I''m guessing the Queen, but try adjusting brightness and contrast to bring more details out, and use a greater depth of field to keep everything in focus.</td>', 'Check out //www.m-w.com to spell "imminent" correctly, and then check out //www.neatimage.com/  and download Neat Image to get rid of all that noise; it works wonders.  Besides that, the black piece blends into the background so i can''t tell what it is.  I''m guessing the Queen, but try adjusting brightness and contrast to bring more details out, and use a greater depth of field to keep everything in focus.', '2003-02-01 06:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(204553, 11420, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good, but needs rotating slightly ccw?  Would have looked better symmetric I think.<br/>Technical: A little more lighting at the top/back of the photo may have made a stronger impact.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Could have been excellent, but lacked sheen.  6</td>', 'Composition: Good, but needs rotating slightly ccw?  Would have looked better symmetric I think.Technical: A little more lighting at the top/back of the photo may have made a stronger impact.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Could have been excellent, but lacked sheen.  6', '2003-02-01 06:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(204554, 11456, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Nicely symmetric<br/>Technical: Good colour and uniform lighting.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Maybe a secondary subject bottom left would look good?  7</td>', 'Composition: Nicely symmetricTechnical: Good colour and uniform lighting.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Maybe a secondary subject bottom left would look good?  7', '2003-02-01 06:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(204555, 11560, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Would have cropped the sky either side of the tower fairly tight myself.<br/>Technical: Not perfect focus, but I guess that''s due to distance.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: I like architecture, but is lacking interest slightly, for me.  Shape of the pic really gives a snapshot quality (sorry).  Always worth considering cropping.  6</td>', 'Composition: Would have cropped the sky either side of the tower fairly tight myself.Technical: Not perfect focus, but I guess that''s due to distance.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: I like architecture, but is lacking interest slightly, for me.  Shape of the pic really gives a snapshot quality (sorry).  Always worth considering cropping.  6', '2003-02-01 06:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(204556, 11632, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Photo frame angle looks slightly wrong.<br/>Technical: Nice colour and lighting.  Focus isn''t great, but this doesn''t detract from the pic too much.  Was the white area around the pic intentional?<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: 6</td>', 'Composition: Photo frame angle looks slightly wrong.Technical: Nice colour and lighting.  Focus isn''t great, but this doesn''t detract from the pic too much.  Was the white area around the pic intentional?Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: 6', '2003-02-01 06:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(204557, 11598, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good<br/>Technical: Nice choice of layout.  Focus isn''t bad, but the pic seems noisy, and lack of vibrancy lets it down slightly.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: You were unfortunate to pick a very common subject, meaning you had lots of comparable competition.  6</td>', 'Composition: GoodTechnical: Nice choice of layout.  Focus isn''t bad, but the pic seems noisy, and lack of vibrancy lets it down slightly.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: You were unfortunate to pick a very common subject, meaning you had lots of comparable competition.  6', '2003-02-01 06:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(204558, 11484, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good.  Brightness of the right face contrasts well with the darkness of the left.<br/>Technical: Good choice of colour and contrast.  Nice border.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Technically good and nice pic.  8</td>', 'Composition: Good.  Brightness of the right face contrasts well with the darkness of the left.Technical: Good choice of colour and contrast.  Nice border.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Technically good and nice pic.  8', '2003-02-01 06:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(204559, 11506, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good<br/>Technical: Nice DOF.  Would have liked more event lighting, particularly at the top of the pic.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Good technically, but not sure of the balance of the pic.  6</td>', 'Composition: GoodTechnical: Nice DOF.  Would have liked more event lighting, particularly at the top of the pic.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Good technically, but not sure of the balance of the pic.  6', '2003-02-01 06:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(204561, 11528, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Ideally would see the whole mirror and less extra space around it (bottom and right particularly).  Also photographer should be out of shot? :-)<br/>Technical: Good focus and lighting.<br/>Meets challenge: Not for me, sorry.<br/>Overall impression: Nice idea but let down technically.  4</td>', 'Composition: Ideally would see the whole mirror and less extra space around it (bottom and right particularly).  Also photographer should be out of shot? :-)Technical: Good focus and lighting.Meets challenge: Not for me, sorry.Overall impression: Nice idea but let down technically.  4', '2003-02-01 06:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(204566, 11356, 3306, '<td valign="top">I love the ethereal feel and the symmetry of your picture. Very unique. One of my favorites this week.</td>', 'I love the ethereal feel and the symmetry of your picture. Very unique. One of my favorites this week.', '2003-02-01 08:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(204568, 11460, 3306, '<td valign="top">I also did a \"square meal\" picture this week. I really like the colors you have used and the symmetry. I especially like what you did with the oranges! I wish you had left a little more room in your picture to capture  the sides of your plates. Good luck.</td>', 'I also did a \"square meal\" picture this week. I really like the colors you have used and the symmetry. I especially like what you did with the oranges! I wish you had left a little more room in your picture to capture  the sides of your plates. Good luck.', '2003-02-01 08:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(204569, 11597, 2978, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very creative. One of my fave this week. Good luck</td>', 'Great shot, very creative. One of my fave this week. Good luck', '2003-02-01 08:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(204570, 11596, 2978, '<td valign="top">Amusing photo but I have trouble relating to the topic.</td>', 'Amusing photo but I have trouble relating to the topic.', '2003-02-01 08:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(204571, 11547, 2978, '<td valign="top">Great. Good luck with this one</td>', 'Great. Good luck with this one', '2003-02-01 08:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(204572, 11373, 2978, '<td valign="top">Good composition. IMO it would be nice if we can see more detail below the ceiling.</td>', 'Good composition. IMO it would be nice if we can see more detail below the ceiling.', '2003-02-01 08:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(204573, 11552, 2978, '<td valign="top">It''s very sharp. I even think it''s generated directly fron PS. The image itself is not stunning much. IMO</td>', 'It''s very sharp. I even think it''s generated directly fron PS. The image itself is not stunning much. IMO', '2003-02-01 08:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(204574, 11647, 2978, '<td valign="top">This makes my smile :-) Can I have one kiss?</td>', 'This makes my smile :-) Can I have one kiss?', '2003-02-01 08:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(204576, 11436, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good clear sharp pic.  I don''t like the crop.  I think its a little tight.  It looks like a macro demo shot from a filter or camera mfg.   It is very well taken though and the color is good. - Inspzil</td>', 'Good clear sharp pic.  I don''t like the crop.  I think its a little tight.  It looks like a macro demo shot from a filter or camera mfg.   It is very well taken though and the color is good. - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 08:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(204577, 11649, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is really neat.  I think it might make for a good pic, but the time of day is too close to noon.  Later in the day when the sun is directly overhead and the sky is a little bluer would be preferable to my tastes.  - Inspzil</td>', 'This is really neat.  I think it might make for a good pic, but the time of day is too close to noon.  Later in the day when the sun is directly overhead and the sky is a little bluer would be preferable to my tastes.  - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 09:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(204578, 11490, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great color.  It sure is a square.  It looks a little oversharpened to me though.  Not a bad pic overall - Inspzil</td>', 'Great color.  It sure is a square.  It looks a little oversharpened to me though.  Not a bad pic overall - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 09:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(204579, 11432, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great title.  The picture isn''t too bad either. The CD''s make for a great background with better color and light effects.  Nice idea and good pic - Inspzil</td>', 'Great title.  The picture isn''t too bad either. The CD''s make for a great background with better color and light effects.  Nice idea and good pic - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 09:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(204580, 11352, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!!  Photo is pretty flat without much WOW factor, but I gotta admit it was a hell of an idea.  I never woulda thunk it.  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'Nice idea!!  Photo is pretty flat without much WOW factor, but I gotta admit it was a hell of an idea.  I never woulda thunk it.  Good luck - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 09:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(204582, 11476, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good motion shot.  I think you needed a little higher aperture to keep the die from getting blurry.  Awesome color though.  The reds are jumping off the page.  Nice shot - Inspzil</td>', 'Good motion shot.  I think you needed a little higher aperture to keep the die from getting blurry.  Awesome color though.  The reds are jumping off the page.  Nice shot - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 09:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(204584, 11556, 3540, '<td valign="top">This subject is too long for this type of macro.  A better angle and I think you might''ve been able to capture it properly.  The background is good, but it looks like the part of the pic in the best focus is the bottom right corner of the background above the blurry stuff of course - Inspzil</td>', 'This subject is too long for this type of macro.  A better angle and I think you might''ve been able to capture it properly.  The background is good, but it looks like the part of the pic in the best focus is the bottom right corner of the background above the blurry stuff of course - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 10:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(204585, 11535, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is practically porn.  :)  It looks like it could be Big Boys butt too.  I like the pattern, but this is photography, not wallpaper judging.  I enjoy the humor in the title but I don''t see anything redeeming about the picture - Inspzil</td>', 'This is practically porn.  :)  It looks like it could be Big Boys butt too.  I like the pattern, but this is photography, not wallpaper judging.  I enjoy the humor in the title but I don''t see anything redeeming about the picture - Inspzil', '2003-02-01 10:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(204588, 11646, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow, can''t believe there''s another shot with disquettes this week.  I like this one better, more orgainzed and clean.  Good job.  jacko.  8</td>', 'Wow, can''t believe there''s another shot with disquettes this week.  I like this one better, more orgainzed and clean.  Good job.  jacko.  8', '2003-02-01 11:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
