(204590, 11556, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Finally a computer chip shot that is beautifull to the eye ... too many bad pictures of mother boards out there.   Love the composotioin (placement and use of negative space) and the shallow depth of field (in back).  Would really liike to see more DOF in front though.  Nonetheless, the best computer chip picture yet on DPC.  Good luck.  9</td>', 'Wow.  Finally a computer chip shot that is beautifull to the eye ... too many bad pictures of mother boards out there.   Love the composotioin (placement and use of negative space) and the shallow depth of field (in back).  Would really liike to see more DOF in front though.  Nonetheless, the best computer chip picture yet on DPC.  Good luck.  9', '2003-02-01 11:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(204592, 11419, 2716, '<td valign="top">Love the compositoin.  Great idea.  However, I''d like to see it in colour (bright green and black background) ... it would make a bigger impact.  convertin to B&amp;W makes the image look to dark.  HOwever, great composition so I''ll give you an 8.  Good luck.  Jacko  8</td>', 'Love the compositoin.  Great idea.  However, I''d like to see it in colour (bright green and black background) ... it would make a bigger impact.  convertin to B&W makes the image look to dark.  HOwever, great composition so I''ll give you an 8.  Good luck.  Jacko  8', '2003-02-01 11:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(204593, 11613, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very simple (including the bordre).  I like it.  I''m trying to decide if I''d like it a tad better if it wouldn''t fill the frame so tightly (less tight crop).  Just something to try out later.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Very simple (including the bordre).  I like it.  I''m trying to decide if I''d like it a tad better if it wouldn''t fill the frame so tightly (less tight crop).  Just something to try out later.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8', '2003-02-01 11:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
