(204620, 11499, 4648, '<td valign="top">Wow, the angle really through me off for quite a while.  It makes the letters look like they are on the side of the keys.  I really like this illusion.  You got me.  The focus is a little soft, but what the heck I''m still intrigued by the angle.  I still have to look for a minute to see the letters correctly.  Worth a 10 all day long.  Great one.</td>', 'Wow, the angle really through me off for quite a while.  It makes the letters look like they are on the side of the keys.  I really like this illusion.  You got me.  The focus is a little soft, but what the heck I''m still intrigued by the angle.  I still have to look for a minute to see the letters correctly.  Worth a 10 all day long.  Great one.', '2003-02-01 12:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(204621, 11519, 4514, '<td valign="top">Just a tad too dark.</td>', 'Just a tad too dark.', '2003-02-01 12:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(204622, 11667, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is what I call nice DOF.  Great job.  Didn''t you have any other colored marbles?  I love the blue square.  Great shot.</td>', 'This is what I call nice DOF.  Great job.  Didn''t you have any other colored marbles?  I love the blue square.  Great shot.', '2003-02-01 12:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(204623, 11462, 4648, '<td valign="top">That looks like "Help" to me.  I read lips.  Neat idea.  Sure is different and well done.  I especially like your build in border.  Good job.</td>', 'That looks like "Help" to me.  I read lips.  Neat idea.  Sure is different and well done.  I especially like your build in border.  Good job.', '2003-02-01 13:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(204624, 11487, 4501, '<td valign="top">Agreat interpretation of "squares" well done</td>', 'Agreat interpretation of "squares" well done', '2003-02-01 13:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(204625, 11516, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great simplicity.  The only problem with going with something so simple is things stand out and are to easily spotted.  It would have been perfect had all your shadows been square.  As it is only 1 is square.  This jumps out and with the challenge title it cries for all to be square.  Otherwise great idea with good execution.</td>', 'Great simplicity.  The only problem with going with something so simple is things stand out and are to easily spotted.  It would have been perfect had all your shadows been square.  As it is only 1 is square.  This jumps out and with the challenge title it cries for all to be square.  Otherwise great idea with good execution.', '2003-02-01 13:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(204627, 11456, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is strange.  It appears to be out of focus, but with closer looking it is not out of focus.  The black bleeds into the orange.   This plays tricks on my eyes and I''m not sure how I feel about that.  First glance says 5, but further looking says 6 for the illusion.  Going with further looking.</td>', 'This is strange.  It appears to be out of focus, but with closer looking it is not out of focus.  The black bleeds into the orange.   This plays tricks on my eyes and I''m not sure how I feel about that.  First glance says 5, but further looking says 6 for the illusion.  Going with further looking.', '2003-02-01 13:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(204628, 11590, 4648, '<td valign="top">I LOVE IT!!  I especially like the tear of the paper.  Feels strange to give toilet paper a score of 8.</td>', 'I LOVE IT!!  I especially like the tear of the paper.  Feels strange to give toilet paper a score of 8.', '2003-02-01 13:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(204629, 11368, 4648, '<td valign="top">What give this "square meal" it all over the others is the destroyed flat wear.  That''s going the extra mile for it.  The background does need smoothed out a little</td>', 'What give this "square meal" it all over the others is the destroyed flat wear.  That''s going the extra mile for it.  The background does need smoothed out a little', '2003-02-01 13:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(204633, 11448, 4648, '<td valign="top">This plays with the mind and eyes.  It appears to curve on the left edge, which we know it does not.  It also appears to tilt to the left, because of the placement of the squares inside the yellow.  I don''t like modern art but this is good art.  One nit pick - the eye should have been centered in the square.  There''s space on the nose side and almost cut off on the other side.  Beautiful green eye.  Well done.</td>', 'This plays with the mind and eyes.  It appears to curve on the left edge, which we know it does not.  It also appears to tilt to the left, because of the placement of the squares inside the yellow.  I don''t like modern art but this is good art.  One nit pick - the eye should have been centered in the square.  There''s space on the nose side and almost cut off on the other side.  Beautiful green eye.  Well done.', '2003-02-01 13:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(204634, 11588, 4648, '<td valign="top">Only problem I can see is your photo is not perfectly level.  My tripod has a level on it.  Worth investing in.  Still a good photo.</td>', 'Only problem I can see is your photo is not perfectly level.  My tripod has a level on it.  Worth investing in.  Still a good photo.', '2003-02-01 13:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(204636, 11587, 4648, '<td valign="top">Should have been cropped closer on left side   Subject appears to be on the placemat, in my opinion therefore cropping should have been even around that.  Otherwise great composition, expecially color co-ordination and attention to detail, down to tag on tea bag.  Nice job.  Well photographed.</td>', 'Should have been cropped closer on left side   Subject appears to be on the placemat, in my opinion therefore cropping should have been even around that.  Otherwise great composition, expecially color co-ordination and attention to detail, down to tag on tea bag.  Nice job.  Well photographed.', '2003-02-01 13:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(204638, 11571, 4648, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Like the DOF and the texture.  Can almost feel the rust on the post.  Good job.</td>', 'Well done!  Like the DOF and the texture.  Can almost feel the rust on the post.  Good job.', '2003-02-01 13:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(204641, 11621, 4648, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but not sure I like the DOF.  I would have prefered either Perfect focus at first down to where you have it or all in focus.  leaning towards all in focus.  Great composition, would just like different execution personally.</td>', 'I like the idea but not sure I like the DOF.  I would have prefered either Perfect focus at first down to where you have it or all in focus.  leaning towards all in focus.  Great composition, would just like different execution personally.', '2003-02-01 13:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(204644, 11578, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  If not a house boat, what is it.  Great photo with beautiful focus and clarity.  I really like the angle the photo is taken at.  It''s a 10 for me.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  If not a house boat, what is it.  Great photo with beautiful focus and clarity.  I really like the angle the photo is taken at.  It''s a 10 for me.', '2003-02-01 13:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(204646, 11455, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky.  Don''t know what the free standing "thing" in the middle of the photo is, but I like it.  It makes a snapshot into a photo.  Well done.  I like the soft focus.</td>', 'Beautiful sky.  Don''t know what the free standing "thing" in the middle of the photo is, but I like it.  It makes a snapshot into a photo.  Well done.  I like the soft focus.', '2003-02-01 13:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(204647, 11542, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too much empty space for me personally.  Otherwise beautiful.</td>', 'Too much empty space for me personally.  Otherwise beautiful.', '2003-02-01 13:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(204648, 11665, 4648, '<td valign="top">You did 3 times the work the others did.  I personally like the fact that your background is folded to where the creases make squares also.  Others will probable tell you should have been smooth.  To me it is carrying the square theme further.  Nice clear and colorful photo.  Well done.</td>', 'You did 3 times the work the others did.  I personally like the fact that your background is folded to where the creases make squares also.  Others will probable tell you should have been smooth.  To me it is carrying the square theme further.  Nice clear and colorful photo.  Well done.', '2003-02-01 13:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(204650, 11565, 4648, '<td valign="top">I like the addition of the little girl.  I can''t have my cake and eat it to.  I like the DOF but I also would like her in focus.  Your way is really best.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the addition of the little girl.  I can''t have my cake and eat it to.  I like the DOF but I also would like her in focus.  Your way is really best.  Well done.', '2003-02-01 13:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(204652, 11545, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great macro.  What country is this from and what is sticking out each side of his head?  Well executed photo.  Great clarity, can almost feel the texture of the coin.  Well done.</td>', 'Great macro.  What country is this from and what is sticking out each side of his head?  Well executed photo.  Great clarity, can almost feel the texture of the coin.  Well done.', '2003-02-01 13:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(204653, 11459, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute kid.  What is all over his fingers that is red?  Indirect light would have lighten the background without washing it out.  Still not bad at all.</td>', 'Cute kid.  What is all over his fingers that is red?  Indirect light would have lighten the background without washing it out.  Still not bad at all.', '2003-02-01 14:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(204655, 11382, 4648, '<td valign="top">A great tool.  Wish your background had been light so the whole tool could be seen.  That''s my only complaint, but it does make a big difference to me.  From a 9 to a 6.</td>', 'A great tool.  Wish your background had been light so the whole tool could be seen.  That''s my only complaint, but it does make a big difference to me.  From a 9 to a 6.', '2003-02-01 14:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
