(204659, 11607, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is just my personal opinion but I don''t like the angle of the camera when taking this photo.  Also there is only one square and you cropped it off.  In our mind we know all the colors are squares but we don''t see it.  The angle makes me feel like I''m falling as I look at the photo.  Personally this has no appeal.</td>', 'This is just my personal opinion but I don''t like the angle of the camera when taking this photo.  Also there is only one square and you cropped it off.  In our mind we know all the colors are squares but we don''t see it.  The angle makes me feel like I''m falling as I look at the photo.  Personally this has no appeal.', '2003-02-01 14:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(204661, 11599, 4648, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail is very deceiving.  I love this.  Great composition with execellent execution.  Wonderful photograph.  I like how the square is offset from the center of the photo.  Works beautifully.  I love the other rockes.  Great photo.  It''s a 10</td>', 'The thumbnail is very deceiving.  I love this.  Great composition with execellent execution.  Wonderful photograph.  I like how the square is offset from the center of the photo.  Works beautifully.  I love the other rockes.  Great photo.  It''s a 10', '2003-02-01 14:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(204662, 11372, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Great composition.  Neat idea.  Like that it''s different.  Nice choice of places to take the photo.  Love the hills in the distance.  They bring a finish to the photo.  Well done.  Should be up there in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Great composition.  Neat idea.  Like that it''s different.  Nice choice of places to take the photo.  Love the hills in the distance.  They bring a finish to the photo.  Well done.  Should be up there in the challenge.', '2003-02-01 14:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
