(204683, 11567, 4648, '<td valign="top">When one says blocks I automatically think wooden.  These appear to be concrete or brick.  Is that why you chose sepia tone?  Doesn''t really matter the material I guess.  Good focus, clear and sharp.  Needs to be just a lighter for me.  Still not a bad photo at all.</td>', 'When one says blocks I automatically think wooden.  These appear to be concrete or brick.  Is that why you chose sepia tone?  Doesn''t really matter the material I guess.  Good focus, clear and sharp.  Needs to be just a lighter for me.  Still not a bad photo at all.', '2003-02-01 15:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(204684, 11490, 4648, '<td valign="top">Clear and sharp.  Cropping needs to be equal all the way around and you have much more space at the bottom, and sides, than at the top.  But this is just my opinion.  Otherwise nice one.</td>', 'Clear and sharp.  Cropping needs to be equal all the way around and you have much more space at the bottom, and sides, than at the top.  But this is just my opinion.  Otherwise nice one.', '2003-02-01 15:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
