(204908, 11541, 1829, '<td valign="top">Beautiful strong greens in your photo.  I like how you have cut the square shaped leaf there, the water adds a nice touch.  Lighting and composition are just brilliant.  Excellent job.  GL</td>', 'Beautiful strong greens in your photo.  I like how you have cut the square shaped leaf there, the water adds a nice touch.  Lighting and composition are just brilliant.  Excellent job.  GL', '2003-02-02 07:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(204909, 11534, 1829, '<td valign="top">Great vibrant colours.  Excellent composition.  The circle effect surrounding the square shape is awesome.  Very creative indeed.  GL</td>', 'Great vibrant colours.  Excellent composition.  The circle effect surrounding the square shape is awesome.  Very creative indeed.  GL', '2003-02-02 07:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(204910, 11382, 1829, '<td valign="top">Very creative image.  I love the black and whites with the chrome.  These work very well.  The composition is brilliant also.  I love how you have highlighted your image with the black background.  Almost seems like the white squares just hanging there.  EXCELLENT JOB!!  GL 10</td>', 'Very creative image.  I love the black and whites with the chrome.  These work very well.  The composition is brilliant also.  I love how you have highlighted your image with the black background.  Almost seems like the white squares just hanging there.  EXCELLENT JOB!!  GL 10', '2003-02-02 07:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(204911, 11555, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent colour here.  I love the shadows and composition.  Ths soft effect works well too.  Looks like you had fun with this.  GL</td>', 'Excellent colour here.  I love the shadows and composition.  Ths soft effect works well too.  Looks like you had fun with this.  GL', '2003-02-02 07:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(204912, 11419, 1829, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  Love the way you have placed the leaves in the square like figure.  I also love the composition and the b&amp;w works well here.  Certainly a work of art.  Well done  GL</td>', 'Very creative.  Love the way you have placed the leaves in the square like figure.  I also love the composition and the b&w works well here.  Certainly a work of art.  Well done  GL', '2003-02-02 07:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(204913, 11646, 1829, '<td valign="top">Great vibrant colours.  I like your idea of composition and using all of the frame to create this effective outcome.  Excellent work and GL</td>', 'Great vibrant colours.  I like your idea of composition and using all of the frame to create this effective outcome.  Excellent work and GL', '2003-02-02 07:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(204914, 11517, 1829, '<td valign="top">Oh yum.  Did you eat this after you took the shot?  I would have..lol.  Great colours pink, blue and white.  Your composition is fantastic in the way that you have placed a square object inside a round object.  Very creative.  GL.</td>', 'Oh yum.  Did you eat this after you took the shot?  I would have..lol.  Great colours pink, blue and white.  Your composition is fantastic in the way that you have placed a square object inside a round object.  Very creative.  GL.', '2003-02-02 07:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(204915, 11432, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent background colours off the cd''s.  The composition is great as well as the framing in which you chose.  Excellent creative work.  GL.</td>', 'Excellent background colours off the cd''s.  The composition is great as well as the framing in which you chose.  Excellent creative work.  GL.', '2003-02-02 07:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(204916, 11448, 1829, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  The yellow colour caught my eye.  Excellent work.  GL</td>', 'Very creative.  The yellow colour caught my eye.  Excellent work.  GL', '2003-02-02 07:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(204919, 11672, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice angle + I like the star burst.  Jacko.</td>', 'Nice angle + I like the star burst.  Jacko.', '2003-02-02 08:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(204920, 11444, 2716, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  They sure look yummy!  Good interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Good shot.  They sure look yummy!  Good interpretation of the challenge.', '2003-02-02 08:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(204921, 11668, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  I like your choice of background and "ground", both blue.  Very nice placement of the pieces.  Goo luck.  Jacko.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  I like your choice of background and "ground", both blue.  Very nice placement of the pieces.  Goo luck.  Jacko.', '2003-02-02 08:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(204922, 11420, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colours and concept.  you will want to try to make the horizontal lines parallel to the horizon in the future.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice bright colours and concept.  you will want to try to make the horizontal lines parallel to the horizon in the future.  Good luck.', '2003-02-02 08:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(204923, 11517, 2716, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of colours.  I can''t believe I''m saying that about blue and pink, but it works really effectively.  Lovely composition.  great shaprness.  Good luck.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Beautiful use of colours.  I can''t believe I''m saying that about blue and pink, but it works really effectively.  Lovely composition.  great shaprness.  Good luck.  Jacko.  9', '2003-02-02 08:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(204924, 11428, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, very creative.  I think you should have taken a bit more time and cut out black shapes, then used the funky square you used.  The other shapes look a bit too dirty.  However, I like your idea.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Nice idea, very creative.  I think you should have taken a bit more time and cut out black shapes, then used the funky square you used.  The other shapes look a bit too dirty.  However, I like your idea.  Jacko.  7', '2003-02-02 08:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(204925, 11621, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple shot.  Very effective.  My personal preference would be to use more depth of field.    I still think this is a great shot.  Good luck.  Jacko.</td>', 'Nice and simple shot.  Very effective.  My personal preference would be to use more depth of field.    I still think this is a great shot.  Good luck.  Jacko.', '2003-02-02 08:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(204927, 11359, 2716, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours.  I think a dead on shot would made the squares stand out even more.   Jacko.</td>', 'Beautiful colours.  I think a dead on shot would made the squares stand out even more.   Jacko.', '2003-02-02 08:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(204929, 11575, 2716, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours.  Interesting inclusing of the building on the right.</td>', 'Gorgeous colours.  Interesting inclusing of the building on the right.', '2003-02-02 08:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(204930, 11377, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very interesting B&amp;W.  I really like the various angles in this shot.  very effective.  Good job.  Jacko.</td>', 'Very interesting B&W.  I really like the various angles in this shot.  very effective.  Good job.  Jacko.', '2003-02-02 08:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(204931, 11547, 2716, '<td valign="top">Dang, I never would have thought of a tennis/badminton racket for my source of squares.  Cute motion blur.  The background looks a bit messy because of the wrinkles.  Lovely bright colours.  Good luck.  Jacko.</td>', 'Dang, I never would have thought of a tennis/badminton racket for my source of squares.  Cute motion blur.  The background looks a bit messy because of the wrinkles.  Lovely bright colours.  Good luck.  Jacko.', '2003-02-02 08:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(204932, 11390, 2716, '<td valign="top">I love my carpenter''s square.  Cute shot, but i looks a bit messy:  the stains on the background, the rust on the squares (which tells me it hasn''t been used in a while) and the overall colours don''t seem to work together.</td>', 'I love my carpenter''s square.  Cute shot, but i looks a bit messy:  the stains on the background, the rust on the squares (which tells me it hasn''t been used in a while) and the overall colours don''t seem to work together.', '2003-02-02 08:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(204933, 11473, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow. finally a shot with a figurine that I like.  Very nice interpretation of the challenge, and cute title.  The only thing I''d change, I''m being anal retentive but it really stands out, you should try to make the bottom line parallel to the horizon.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Wow. finally a shot with a figurine that I like.  Very nice interpretation of the challenge, and cute title.  The only thing I''d change, I''m being anal retentive but it really stands out, you should try to make the bottom line parallel to the horizon.  Jacko.  8', '2003-02-02 08:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(204935, 11456, 2716, '<td valign="top">This is symetrical but it somehow looks crooked, leaning to the left?  I dunno, I like the colours and the graininess of the squares.  Good luck.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'This is symetrical but it somehow looks crooked, leaning to the left?  I dunno, I like the colours and the graininess of the squares.  Good luck.  Jacko.  7', '2003-02-02 08:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(204936, 11620, 2716, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  The light seems a bit harsh, but I really your composition.  Good luck.  Jacko  8</td>', 'Cute shot.  The light seems a bit harsh, but I really your composition.  Good luck.  Jacko  8', '2003-02-02 08:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(204937, 11519, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol, that''s a funny lookin'' fish.  Cute shot.  the light seem pretty dark, you might to brighten it up in Photoshop/Päintshop Pro.  Good luck.</td>', 'lol, that''s a funny lookin'' fish.  Cute shot.  the light seem pretty dark, you might to brighten it up in Photoshop/Päintshop Pro.  Good luck.', '2003-02-02 08:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(204939, 11664, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like the angles, but I don''t like the fact that i''s pretty much the same  the submission as the one in the  Windows and doors challenge.</td>', 'Wow, I really like the angles, but I don''t like the fact that i''s pretty much the same  the submission as the one in the  Windows and doors challenge.', '2003-02-02 08:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
