(204941, 11562, 2716, '<td valign="top">Looke pretty messy and disorganised at first, but I really like it now.  Has that industrial feel to it.  Goo job.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Looke pretty messy and disorganised at first, but I really like it now.  Has that industrial feel to it.  Goo job.  Jacko.  8', '2003-02-02 08:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
