(204987, 11556, 1880, '<td valign="top">Your background is in better focus than your subject... I like shallow DOF but you have missed here slightly.  You need to get all of your subject including the prongs in focus while creating a shallow DOF behind and in front of the cpu...  5 ... Bob</td>', 'Your background is in better focus than your subject... I like shallow DOF but you have missed here slightly.  You need to get all of your subject including the prongs in focus while creating a shallow DOF behind and in front of the cpu...  5 ... Bob', '2003-02-02 11:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
