(205145, 11356, 4267, '<td valign="top">great trick! I wonder how many will figure it out</td>', 'great trick! I wonder how many will figure it out', '2003-02-02 14:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(205146, 11438, 4267, '<td valign="top">lol your nuts... bonus points for you!</td>', 'lol your nuts... bonus points for you!', '2003-02-02 14:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(205148, 11410, 806, '<td valign="top">This is incredible! Her expression is so moving, and the restraint due to the fence/barrier.... Is she wanting to come out? or Is she sorry I am in? I am only left to wonder. Look how she seems to be looking back .. almost over her shoulder. She is almost indifferent to the situation.. yet needs to respond to it out of obligation. The tones are harsh, yet even providing more emotion. The clarity and focus are just as they should be, and the lighting perfect.<br/>I am amazed with this piece. My first favorite in several weeks, and my only 10 this week. Congratulations!</td>', 'This is incredible! Her expression is so moving, and the restraint due to the fence/barrier.... Is she wanting to come out? or Is she sorry I am in? I am only left to wonder. Look how she seems to be looking back .. almost over her shoulder. She is almost indifferent to the situation.. yet needs to respond to it out of obligation. The tones are harsh, yet even providing more emotion. The clarity and focus are just as they should be, and the lighting perfect.I am amazed with this piece. My first favorite in several weeks, and my only 10 this week. Congratulations!', '2003-02-02 14:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(205149, 11565, 806, '<td valign="top">Great! Shows action and usefulness rather than just documenting the blocks. The child is in the right place and right dof to make this work. Perhaps her hand and the block she is holding could be in a bit better focus, and not so much the ones on the bottom. Nice job!</td>', 'Great! Shows action and usefulness rather than just documenting the blocks. The child is in the right place and right dof to make this work. Perhaps her hand and the block she is holding could be in a bit better focus, and not so much the ones on the bottom. Nice job!', '2003-02-02 15:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(205150, 11632, 806, '<td valign="top">the focus in this image is way off. It would also be better to fill your frame with the image, rather than frame it on 2 sides with white. :( Keep shooting though.</td>', 'the focus in this image is way off. It would also be better to fill your frame with the image, rather than frame it on 2 sides with white. :( Keep shooting though.', '2003-02-02 15:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(205152, 11420, 4815, '<td valign="top">A good crisp shot with bright eye catching colors. A hair more elbow room around the board would be a bonus. Fits the challenge well. I would also like to see a blurry ghost hand move a marker to break up the static quality of the image ( just a personal whim ).  A good straight forward shot.</td>', 'A good crisp shot with bright eye catching colors. A hair more elbow room around the board would be a bonus. Fits the challenge well. I would also like to see a blurry ghost hand move a marker to break up the static quality of the image ( just a personal whim ).  A good straight forward shot.', '2003-02-02 15:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(205153, 11588, 4815, '<td valign="top">I like the simple tones and easy on the eyes composition. A hair  bright on the roof but that''s liveable in my books. I would have cropped out the brown  driveway to give the semi illusion of dangling teeth. But if the bottom brown works for you to give stability to the lower image section that is cool too. A nice comfortable image that settles well with a mug of hot cocoa.</td>', 'I like the simple tones and easy on the eyes composition. A hair  bright on the roof but that''s liveable in my books. I would have cropped out the brown  driveway to give the semi illusion of dangling teeth. But if the bottom brown works for you to give stability to the lower image section that is cool too. A nice comfortable image that settles well with a mug of hot cocoa.', '2003-02-02 15:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(205155, 11598, 4815, '<td valign="top">I like the random splash of CD''s. The odd brightish highlight may offend those purist nitpickers but not me. Some of the metal parts of the CD''s have really cool colour tints, which I personally would like to view more of. Like the funky color thing. As a wee suggestion I find that reds are real eye grabbers and I tend to use them sparingly as accents in a composition. Hence that burgundy square in the top right is hauling my attention more so into that corner. Otherwise a reasonably good image.</td>', 'I like the random splash of CD''s. The odd brightish highlight may offend those purist nitpickers but not me. Some of the metal parts of the CD''s have really cool colour tints, which I personally would like to view more of. Like the funky color thing. As a wee suggestion I find that reds are real eye grabbers and I tend to use them sparingly as accents in a composition. Hence that burgundy square in the top right is hauling my attention more so into that corner. Otherwise a reasonably good image.', '2003-02-02 15:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(205157, 11658, 4815, '<td valign="top">Great concept of geometry. And fab color to boot. Solid composition. Good pattern shot.</td>', 'Great concept of geometry. And fab color to boot. Solid composition. Good pattern shot.', '2003-02-02 15:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(205159, 11408, 4815, '<td valign="top">Well done intellectual comment. I should give you a 10 just for that (haha). The spanky colors certainly attract lots of attention. But my fav visual element is the really cool color contamination among the shadows from multiple lights. The subtle color interplay among reflections form the silver part and green casts from the upper lid are simply mahvelous my dear.  Good tight composition and suitable DOF. Superior creative input deserves much applause. Great show!</td>', 'Well done intellectual comment. I should give you a 10 just for that (haha). The spanky colors certainly attract lots of attention. But my fav visual element is the really cool color contamination among the shadows from multiple lights. The subtle color interplay among reflections form the silver part and green casts from the upper lid are simply mahvelous my dear.  Good tight composition and suitable DOF. Superior creative input deserves much applause. Great show!', '2003-02-02 15:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(205160, 11514, 4815, '<td valign="top">Hot highlights, cor fringing on the bars and not total depth of field  may tick a few marks off from the snobbish crowd. But hey I like the idea of climbing into heaven light myself with some guardian rainbow splashes. I also like the warm splash of sunlight contrasting with the subtle bluish tinge. And the vertical and horizontal lines are perfectly level or perpendicular, a well done feat of camera position. The high key light atmosphere of this image is charming. Warms my techno age heart. Good go!</td>', 'Hot highlights, cor fringing on the bars and not total depth of field  may tick a few marks off from the snobbish crowd. But hey I like the idea of climbing into heaven light myself with some guardian rainbow splashes. I also like the warm splash of sunlight contrasting with the subtle bluish tinge. And the vertical and horizontal lines are perfectly level or perpendicular, a well done feat of camera position. The high key light atmosphere of this image is charming. Warms my techno age heart. Good go!', '2003-02-02 15:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(205162, 11557, 4648, '<td valign="top">Better than that box I like the squares it is sitting on.  They are beautiful.  I can feel the blocks walking barefoot on them.  Love the color of the box and the color of the squares.  Perfect combination.  Great photo for this challenge.</td>', 'Better than that box I like the squares it is sitting on.  They are beautiful.  I can feel the blocks walking barefoot on them.  Love the color of the box and the color of the squares.  Perfect combination.  Great photo for this challenge.', '2003-02-02 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(205163, 11656, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful wood the shadow is on.  And I really like how inside the square is real bright and around the outside is darker.  Well done.  The wood appears different inside the square, other than just the light.  Nice one.</td>', 'Beautiful wood the shadow is on.  And I really like how inside the square is real bright and around the outside is darker.  Well done.  The wood appears different inside the square, other than just the light.  Nice one.', '2003-02-02 15:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(205164, 11619, 4648, '<td valign="top">The crab looks good but I''m not too sure about whatever that is under the olive.  Doesn''t really look like sour cream.  This is a unique idea.  Well thought out and well photographed.  The cropping doesn''t do anything for me, one way or another.  The shadow bothers me a little.  Maybe some secondary light.  Other than the shadow the brightness is real good.  Good over all shot.</td>', 'The crab looks good but I''m not too sure about whatever that is under the olive.  Doesn''t really look like sour cream.  This is a unique idea.  Well thought out and well photographed.  The cropping doesn''t do anything for me, one way or another.  The shadow bothers me a little.  Maybe some secondary light.  Other than the shadow the brightness is real good.  Good over all shot.', '2003-02-02 15:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(205167, 11500, 4648, '<td valign="top">Wish I could do that with my computer.  Nice combination of colors, soft relaxing ones.  You deserve a score for being able to do this and for taking a really good photo.  Nice way to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Wish I could do that with my computer.  Nice combination of colors, soft relaxing ones.  You deserve a score for being able to do this and for taking a really good photo.  Nice way to meet the challenge.', '2003-02-02 15:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(205168, 11506, 4648, '<td valign="top">I see the squares and I see the "A" and the "S" (barely), now what?  I know these 2 letters have something to do with it because they are in the title but what?  Since they are in the title they should be lighter and in better focus, in my opinion.  Hope you explain this one.</td>', 'I see the squares and I see the "A" and the "S" (barely), now what?  I know these 2 letters have something to do with it because they are in the title but what?  Since they are in the title they should be lighter and in better focus, in my opinion.  Hope you explain this one.', '2003-02-02 16:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(205170, 11535, 4648, '<td valign="top">Sure meets the challenge of "square" but maybe ought to be counted off  because your squares are rounded some.  They''re still good squares.  Looks like the purina chow lady.  Good clean focus, not too bright, but easy to see.  Nice job.</td>', 'Sure meets the challenge of "square" but maybe ought to be counted off  because your squares are rounded some.  They''re still good squares.  Looks like the purina chow lady.  Good clean focus, not too bright, but easy to see.  Nice job.', '2003-02-02 16:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(205171, 11386, 4648, '<td valign="top">I started this, but it got to be a bit too much, as has this one.  Right on for the challenge, nice combination of colors, clean and clear focus.  Technically good photo.  Mercy but it gets to my eyes.  Still it''s a good photo and well done.</td>', 'I started this, but it got to be a bit too much, as has this one.  Right on for the challenge, nice combination of colors, clean and clear focus.  Technically good photo.  Mercy but it gets to my eyes.  Still it''s a good photo and well done.', '2003-02-02 16:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(205174, 11446, 4648, '<td valign="top">At first I thought it was too dark, but it grows on you, the dizzier you get from looking at the close stripes.  This would be great for texture also.  I love how the box just disappears into the background.  Great job.  Well done photo.</td>', 'At first I thought it was too dark, but it grows on you, the dizzier you get from looking at the close stripes.  This would be great for texture also.  I love how the box just disappears into the background.  Great job.  Well done photo.', '2003-02-02 16:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(205177, 11617, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t think I can say it the same twice and it didn''t take the first time.  Strange and uniquely done.  Nothing makes sense to me:  the cropping;  the placement of the red;  the placement of the wooden frames.  Did you use shadows?  Put it all together and it''s a nice piece of modern art.  Very thought provoking and well done.  I hope you explain how you did this.  Very different and well done photo.</td>', 'Don''t think I can say it the same twice and it didn''t take the first time.  Strange and uniquely done.  Nothing makes sense to me:  the cropping;  the placement of the red;  the placement of the wooden frames.  Did you use shadows?  Put it all together and it''s a nice piece of modern art.  Very thought provoking and well done.  I hope you explain how you did this.  Very different and well done photo.', '2003-02-02 16:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(205180, 11370, 4648, '<td valign="top">Wish I could see what your playing pieces are, but not a good angle for that.  I can tell they are not the normal pieces.  And this is my biggest complaint.  This one may sound rediculous but your playing square appears not to be square, wider at the bottom than at the top, or are my eyes playing tricks on me.  To me the frame hurt you on this one.  Without it I might have thought the playing board was all of the photo, and would not have noticed that it isn''t square.  Just a thought.  But still not a bad photo, just not a great one.</td>', 'Wish I could see what your playing pieces are, but not a good angle for that.  I can tell they are not the normal pieces.  And this is my biggest complaint.  This one may sound rediculous but your playing square appears not to be square, wider at the bottom than at the top, or are my eyes playing tricks on me.  To me the frame hurt you on this one.  Without it I might have thought the playing board was all of the photo, and would not have noticed that it isn''t square.  Just a thought.  But still not a bad photo, just not a great one.', '2003-02-02 16:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(205181, 11353, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice. Soft. Easy to look at.  Beautiful color.  Well focused and cropped.  Like the angle and the overall appearance.  Nice one.</td>', 'Nice. Soft. Easy to look at.  Beautiful color.  Well focused and cropped.  Like the angle and the overall appearance.  Nice one.', '2003-02-02 16:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
