(205199, 11590, 772, '<td valign="top">great shot... i really love the concept on this one :)  It reminds me slightly of a shot that I have done in the past... I commend you for working with a subject that stirs negative emotion.  I don''t think I have ever really studied the shape and composition of this scene before.. = 9 - setzler</td>', 'great shot... i really love the concept on this one :)  It reminds me slightly of a shot that I have done in the past... I commend you for working with a subject that stirs negative emotion.  I don''t think I have ever really studied the shape and composition of this scene before.. = 9 - setzler', '2003-02-02 16:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
