(205214, 11569, 5340, '<td valign="top">Good composition.</td>', 'Good composition.', '2003-02-02 17:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(205229, 11389, 4815, '<td valign="top">A wonderful use of shallow selective DOF. The crisp feel and texture of the wood and galvanized fence are visually deliciouso. The rust stain bit is the coup de grace. Good strong rural theme. The angled composiotion is a perfect choice along with the close up view. Very well done!</td>', 'A wonderful use of shallow selective DOF. The crisp feel and texture of the wood and galvanized fence are visually deliciouso. The rust stain bit is the coup de grace. Good strong rural theme. The angled composiotion is a perfect choice along with the close up view. Very well done!', '2003-02-02 17:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(205233, 11587, 4815, '<td valign="top">Boy this was certainly a popular theme. First of all I must say that your choice of color scheme is premium. The tender blues and burgundy with that kiss of yellow is very comfortable on the peepers. The homey wood table is also a lovely touch. There are some minor issues to quibble over such as hot highlights on the tea packages and blue serving dish. But nothing to fret over. I also like the nice glow on the silver utensils. Often they drown away in gray shadows. A pleasing image.</td>', 'Boy this was certainly a popular theme. First of all I must say that your choice of color scheme is premium. The tender blues and burgundy with that kiss of yellow is very comfortable on the peepers. The homey wood table is also a lovely touch. There are some minor issues to quibble over such as hot highlights on the tea packages and blue serving dish. But nothing to fret over. I also like the nice glow on the silver utensils. Often they drown away in gray shadows. A pleasing image.', '2003-02-02 18:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(205235, 11484, 4815, '<td valign="top">A catchy title for a good image. Masterful rendition of tonal range. Detail in the shadows where it counts. Lively highlights without the glare. Lovely gentle grays in the sky. I really like the trunk squiggle beneath the big square. It breaks up the vertical lines very nicely. Superior talent in the B&amp;W dept is evident.</td>', 'A catchy title for a good image. Masterful rendition of tonal range. Detail in the shadows where it counts. Lively highlights without the glare. Lovely gentle grays in the sky. I really like the trunk squiggle beneath the big square. It breaks up the vertical lines very nicely. Superior talent in the B&W dept is evident.', '2003-02-02 18:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(205236, 11460, 3247, '<td valign="top">out of focus</td>', 'out of focus', '2003-02-02 18:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(205237, 11630, 4815, '<td valign="top">A good rural flavoured shot with all of the necessary elements tucked beautifully in a tight frame. The gentle grey tones broken up by the foreground bush are great.  Character that you can sink your teeth into in this image. The pitch black has a real visual punch. Some folks may banter for a touch of more elbow room around the window. A minor personal quibble. A good solid image.</td>', 'A good rural flavoured shot with all of the necessary elements tucked beautifully in a tight frame. The gentle grey tones broken up by the foreground bush are great.  Character that you can sink your teeth into in this image. The pitch black has a real visual punch. Some folks may banter for a touch of more elbow room around the window. A minor personal quibble. A good solid image.', '2003-02-02 18:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(205238, 11369, 5340, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.</td>', 'Very interesting.', '2003-02-02 18:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(205239, 11601, 6349, '<td valign="top">this is the most interesting shot for this challenge and one of only a few photos that actually met the challenge rule that the subject of the photo be the square.  Unfortunately, I''m sure a lot of people wont realize this and will not understand why your background is blurry.  I think the composition is wonderful and I like how the rusty orange and red of the shoes compliment each other.  One of my favorites.  I hope everyone else likes it as much as me. 10</td>', 'this is the most interesting shot for this challenge and one of only a few photos that actually met the challenge rule that the subject of the photo be the square.  Unfortunately, I''m sure a lot of people wont realize this and will not understand why your background is blurry.  I think the composition is wonderful and I like how the rusty orange and red of the shoes compliment each other.  One of my favorites.  I hope everyone else likes it as much as me. 10', '2003-02-02 18:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(205240, 11558, 3247, '<td valign="top">I like the color and contrast.  What if you shot this with only the building v- no veg?</td>', 'I like the color and contrast.  What if you shot this with only the building v- no veg?', '2003-02-02 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(205242, 11351, 4815, '<td valign="top">A very clever idea. Just a few simple tones to clearly state your message. The combination of fork, ice cube and water drop are brilliant. Those three things alone with a plain simple background would  yield even a more powerful image for me ( just a wee suggestion ). The highlights in the glass are strong but necesarry for your choice of lighting. The metal feel of the fork is very good. Just the right balance of shadow and highlights. A touch more space around the fork tines would be another smallish request. Otherwise a very good shot.</td>', 'A very clever idea. Just a few simple tones to clearly state your message. The combination of fork, ice cube and water drop are brilliant. Those three things alone with a plain simple background would  yield even a more powerful image for me ( just a wee suggestion ). The highlights in the glass are strong but necesarry for your choice of lighting. The metal feel of the fork is very good. Just the right balance of shadow and highlights. A touch more space around the fork tines would be another smallish request. Otherwise a very good shot.', '2003-02-02 18:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(205245, 11550, 3247, '<td valign="top">If cleaned before hand, this could be a fabulous shot.</td>', 'If cleaned before hand, this could be a fabulous shot.', '2003-02-02 18:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
